/* Falcon – Website-Übersetzungen (erzeugt; Quelltext Deutsch). keys[i] = deutscher Text, <sprache>[i] = Übersetzung */
window.FALCON_I18N = {"keys":["Seite nicht gefunden – Falcon","Zum Inhalt springen","<img src=\"/assets/logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Start</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funktionen</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Herunterladen</a>","<svg/>Download","Fehler 404","Diese Seite ist <span class=\"grad\">davongeflogen.</span>","Die Adresse gibt es nicht (mehr). Vielleicht hilft dir einer dieser Links weiter.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/\">Zur Startseite</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Download</a>","Der schnelle, fokussierte Browser für Gamer. Kostenlos und Open Source.","Falcon","<a href=\"/funktionen\">Funktionen</a>","<a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a>","<a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a>","<a href=\"/download\">Download</a>","Hilfe","<a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fehler melden</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Changelog</a>","Projekt","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>","<a href=\"/datenschutz\">Datenschutz</a>","<span>© <span data-year=\"\">2026</span> Falcon · MIT-Lizenz</span> <span>Aktuelle Version <span data-version=\"\">…</span></span>","Falcon – Startseite","Hauptmenü","Menü öffnen","Diese Seite gibt es nicht.","Datenschutz – Falcon","Rechtliches","Datenschutz","Wie diese Website und der Browser Falcon mit deinen Daten umgehen.","Kurz gesagt: Diese Website setzt keine Cookies, nutzt keine Analyse- oder Werbe-Tracker und lädt keine Schriften oder Skripte von Dritten. Der Browser Falcon enthält ebenfalls keine Tracker; synchronisierte Daten werden Ende-zu-Ende verschlüsselt.","1. Verantwortlicher","Verantwortlich für diese Website und den Browser Falcon ist Calvin, der Entwickler von Falcon.","Fragen zum Datenschutz kannst du über die <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Issues auf GitHub</a> oder über „Fehler melden“ in Falcon stellen.","2. Diese Website","Hosting bei Vercel","Diese Website wird bei Vercel Inc., 440 N Barranca Ave #4133, Covina, CA 91723, USA gehostet. Beim Aufruf verarbeitet Vercel technisch notwendige Daten wie IP-Adresse, Datum und Uhrzeit, aufgerufene Seite, Browser und Betriebssystem, um die Seite auszuliefern und vor Angriffen zu schützen. Rechtsgrundlage ist unser berechtigtes Interesse an einem sicheren und stabilen Betrieb (Art. 6 Abs. 1 lit. f DSGVO). Vercel ist nach dem EU-US Data Privacy Framework zertifiziert; mehr dazu in der <a href=\"https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Datenschutzerklärung von Vercel</a>.","Aktuelle Version von GitHub","Damit Download-Knopf, Versionsnummer und Neuerungen immer aktuell sind, ruft dein Browser beim Besuch dieser Website öffentliche Informationen von GitHub ab (<code>api.github.com</code>, <code>raw.githubusercontent.com</code>). Dabei wird deine IP-Adresse an GitHub Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA übertragen. Der Download selbst erfolgt ebenfalls über GitHub. Rechtsgrundlage ist Art. 6 Abs. 1 lit. f DSGVO. Siehe auch die <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/de/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Datenschutzerklärung von GitHub</a>.","Cookies und lokaler Speicher","Diese Website setzt keine Cookies. Die abgerufene Versionsnummer und die gewählte Sprache werden im lokalen Speicher deines Browsers abgelegt, damit die Seite schneller lädt; du kannst sie jederzeit in den Browser-Einstellungen löschen.","3. Der Browser Falcon","Falcon funktioniert ohne Konto. Lesezeichen, Verlauf und Einstellungen bleiben dann auf deinem PC. Gespeicherte Passwörter werden mit der Verschlüsselung deines Betriebssystems geschützt.","Falcon-Konto, Sync und FalCoins","Wenn du ein Falcon-Konto erstellst, werden Anmeldung und Datenspeicherung über Google Firebase (Google Ireland Ltd., Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Irland) abgewickelt. Gespeichert werden deine E-Mail-Adresse, dein Anzeigename sowie der Kontostand deiner FalCoins, gekaufte Freischaltungen, Missionsfortschritt und der FalCoin-Verlauf.","Lesezeichen, Passwörter, Verlauf, Einstellungen und offene Tabs werden <b>vor dem Hochladen auf deinem Gerät verschlüsselt</b> (AES-256-GCM). Der Schlüssel ist mit deinem Passwort geschützt; weder Firebase noch der Entwickler können diese Daten lesen. Rechtsgrundlage ist die Erfüllung der Kontofunktionen (Art. 6 Abs. 1 lit. b DSGVO). Du kannst dein Konto samt aller Daten jederzeit in Falcon unter <b>Einstellungen → Konto &amp; Sync → Konto löschen</b> entfernen.","Fehlermeldungen","Meldest du in Falcon einen Fehler, werden Beschreibung, Art der Meldung, Falcon-Version und Datum gespeichert. Die Beschreibung ist auf <code>falcon://reports</code> für alle Falcon-Nutzer anonym einsehbar – gib dort bitte keine persönlichen Informationen an. E-Mail-Adresse, Seitenadresse, Screenshot und Betriebssystem sind freiwillig und nur für den Entwickler sichtbar.","Weitere Dienste","<b>Updates:</b> Falcon fragt bei GitHub nach neuen Versionen.","<b>Gratis-Spiele &amp; Angebote</b> auf der Startseite stammen von GamerPower und CheapShark (abschaltbar).","<b>Website-Symbole</b> (Favicons) werden über einen Dienst von Google geladen.","<b>Werbeblocker:</b> Filterlisten werden einmal pro Woche aus öffentlichen Quellen geladen.","<b>Passwort-Check:</b> Es werden nur die ersten 5 Zeichen eines Hash-Werts an „Have I Been Pwned“ gesendet – nie das Passwort selbst.","<b>Seite übersetzen</b> sendet den Text der Seite an Google Übersetzer.","<b>Erweiterungen</b> werden aus dem Chrome Web Store von Google geladen.","4. Deine Rechte","Du hast das Recht auf Auskunft (Art. 15 DSGVO), Berichtigung (Art. 16), Löschung (Art. 17), Einschränkung der Verarbeitung (Art. 18), Datenübertragbarkeit (Art. 20) und Widerspruch gegen Verarbeitungen auf Grundlage berechtigter Interessen (Art. 21). Außerdem kannst du dich bei einer Datenschutz-Aufsichtsbehörde beschweren (Art. 77 DSGVO).","5. Änderungen","Diese Datenschutzerklärung wird angepasst, wenn sich Falcon oder diese Website ändern. Stand: November 2026.","Datenschutzerklärung für falconbrowser.de und den Browser Falcon.","Download – Falcon","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">Neueste Version</span>","Falcon <span class=\"grad\">herunterladen</span>","Kostenlos, ohne Werbung und Open Source. Nach der Installation hält sich Falcon selbst auf dem neuesten Stand.","Erkannt: Windows-PC · Windows 11","<span class=\"dl-select-ic\" data-platform-icon=\"\"><svg/></span> <span class=\"dl-select-label\">Version für</span> <b data-platform-current=\"\">Windows-PC</b> <svg/>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Windows-PC</b><small>Windows 10 und 11</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Android</b><small>Handy und Tablet, APK</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>iOS-Geräte</b><small>.ipa</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>macOS</b><small>Apple-Chip und Intel</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Linux</b><small>.deb und .rpm</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","Windows-PC","Android","iOS-Geräte","macOS","Linux","<b>Falcon für Windows</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">Neueste Version auf GitHub</span>","<svg/>Für Windows herunterladen","Windows 10 und 11 (64 Bit) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ältere Versionen</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Quellcode</a>","<b>Falcon für Android</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">Neueste Version auf GitHub</span>","<svg/><span data-apk-label=\"\">Für Android herunterladen</span>","Android 7 oder neuer · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ältere Versionen</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Quellcode</a>","<b>Falcon für macOS</b><span data-mac-meta=\"\">Neueste Version wird geladen …</span>","<svg/><span>Für Mac mit Apple-Chip (M1–M4)</span>","<svg/><span>Für Mac mit Intel-Prozessor</span>","macOS 11 (Big Sur) oder neuer · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ältere Versionen</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Quellcode</a>","<b>Falcon für Linux</b><span data-linux-meta=\"\">Neueste Version wird geladen …</span>","<svg/><span>.deb – Ubuntu, Debian, Mint</span>","<svg/><span>.rpm – Fedora, openSUSE</span>","64 Bit (x86_64) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ältere Versionen</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Quellcode</a>","<b>Falcon für iOS-Geräte</b><span data-ios-meta=\"\">Neueste Version wird geladen …</span>","<svg/><span>.ipa herunterladen</span>","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 oder neuer · Installation mit <a href=\"https://github.com/nab138/iloader/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iloader</a> (Windows, macOS, Linux) · Ohne Installation: <a href=\"/app\">Falcon-Web-App</a>","<b data-soon-title=\"\">Bald verfügbar</b><span>In Vorbereitung</span>","Zur Falcon-Web-App","Du kannst oben jederzeit eine andere Version auswählen.","In drei Schritten startklar","Installer herunterladen","Klick oben auf „Für Windows herunterladen“. Die Datei heißt <code>Falcon-Setup-<span data-version=\"\">…</span>.exe</code>.","Installer starten","Zeigt Windows „Der Computer wurde durch Windows geschützt“, klick auf <b>Weitere Informationen → Trotzdem ausführen</b>. Falcon ist noch nicht digital signiert.","Loslegen","Falcon startet direkt. Lesezeichen und Passwörter kannst du aus Chrome, Edge, Opera oder Firefox importieren.","Falcon auf dem Android-Handy","APK herunterladen","Öffne diese Seite auf dem Handy und tippe oben auf „Für Android herunterladen“. Die Datei heißt <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-apk-version=\"\">…</span>.apk</code>.","Installation erlauben","Android fragt, ob dein Browser Apps installieren darf. Tippe auf <b>Einstellungen → Aus dieser Quelle zulassen</b> und dann auf <b>Installieren</b>. Falcon ist noch nicht im Play Store.","Anmelden","Melde dich mit deinem Falcon-Konto an – oder erstelle direkt in der App eins. Lesezeichen, Passwörter, Verlauf und FalCoins sind dann auf Handy und PC dieselben.","Falcon auf dem Mac","DMG herunterladen","Wähle oben deinen Mac: <b>Apple-Chip</b> (M1, M2, M3, M4) oder <b>Intel</b>. Welchen du hast, steht unter → <b>Über diesen Mac</b>.","In „Programme“ ziehen","Öffne die heruntergeladene Datei und ziehe Falcon in den Ordner <b>Programme</b>.","Beim ersten Start erlauben","Falcon ist noch nicht von Apple signiert. Klick Falcon im Ordner Programme mit der rechten Maustaste an → <b>Öffnen</b> → <b>Öffnen</b>. Meldet macOS „beschädigt“, gib im Terminal <code>xattr -cr /Applications/Falcon.app</code> ein und starte Falcon erneut.","Falcon unter Linux","Paket wählen","<b>.deb</b> für Ubuntu, Debian, Linux Mint, Pop!_OS · <b>.rpm</b> für Fedora, openSUSE, RHEL.","Installieren","Doppelklick auf die Datei öffnet die Softwareverwaltung. Im Terminal geht es mit <code>sudo apt install ./Falcon-*.deb</code> bzw. <code>sudo dnf install ./Falcon-*.rpm</code>.","Falcon findest du danach im Anwendungsmenü. Falcon aktualisiert sich wie unter Windows selbst im Hintergrund.","Falcon auf iOS-Geräten","Falcon gibt es nicht im App Store. Du installierst die .ipa mit dem kostenlosen Programm <b>iloader</b> vom Computer aus – mit Windows, macOS oder Linux und deiner normalen Apple-ID.","iloader herunterladen","Lade iloader kostenlos von <b>github.com/nab138/iloader</b> unter „Releases“ herunter (oder von <b>iloader.app</b> – nur diese beiden Quellen sind offiziell). Windows: <code>iloader-windows-x64.msi</code>, macOS: <code>iloader-darwin-universal.dmg</code>, Linux: <code>.deb</code>, <code>.rpm</code> oder <code>.AppImage</code>. Der „Sponsor“-Knopf auf GitHub ist nur eine freiwillige Spende.","Damit der Computer das Gerät erkennt","<b>Windows:</b> installiere zusätzlich <b>iTunes</b> von Apple. <b>macOS:</b> nichts nötig. <b>Linux:</b> <code>usbmuxd</code> installieren, falls es fehlt (Debian/Ubuntu: <code>sudo apt install usbmuxd</code>).",".ipa auf den Computer laden","Lade oben die Datei <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-ios-version=\"\">…</span>.ipa</code> auf den Computer herunter.","Gerät anschließen","Schließe iPhone oder iPad per <b>Datenkabel</b> an, entsperre es und tippe auf „Vertrauen“. Kommt keine „Vertrauen“-Frage und das Gerät lädt nur, probiere ein anderes Kabel oder einen anderen USB-Anschluss.","In iloader anmelden","Öffne iloader und melde dich mit deiner Apple-ID an (eine kostenlose reicht). Klappt die Anmeldung nicht, wähle in den Einstellungen von iloader „Reset Anisette State“ und starte iloader neu.","Falcon installieren","Wähle in iloader dein Gerät, dann <b>„Import IPA“</b> und die Falcon-.ipa. iloader signiert Falcon mit deiner Apple-ID und installiert es auf dem Gerät.","Auf dem Gerät freigeben","Schalte unter <b>Einstellungen → Datenschutz &amp; Sicherheit → Entwicklermodus</b> den Entwicklermodus ein (der Punkt erscheint erst nach der Installation, danach Neustart) und vertraue unter <b>Einstellungen → Allgemein → VPN &amp; Geräteverwaltung</b> deiner Apple-ID. Danach startet Falcon.","Alle 7 Tage neu installieren","Mit einer kostenlosen Apple-ID läuft die Signatur nach 7 Tagen ab. Schließe das Gerät dann wieder an und installiere Falcon erneut mit iloader – deine Daten bleiben erhalten. Neue Falcon-Versionen installierst du genauso.","Was ist neu?","Neuerungen","Alle Änderungen findest du im <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Changelog auf GitHub</a>.","Systemvoraussetzungen","Windows","Windows 10 oder 11, 64 Bit","macOS 11 (Big Sur) oder neuer, Apple-Chip oder Intel","64 Bit, z. B. Ubuntu 20.04+, Debian 11+, Fedora 36+ (.deb oder .rpm)","Arbeitsspeicher","4 GB (8 GB empfohlen)","Speicherplatz","ca. 400 MB","Android 7.0 oder neuer","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 oder neuer, Installation mit iloader am Computer (Windows, macOS oder Linux)","Falcon-Logo","Plattform wählen","Plattform","Falcon kostenlos für Windows, macOS, Linux, Android und iOS herunterladen. Automatische Updates, keine Werbung, Open Source.","FalCoins – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Start</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funktionen</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\" aria-current=\"page\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Herunterladen</a>","FalCoins","Surfen lohnt sich <span class=\"grad\">jetzt doppelt.</span>","Mit einem kostenlosen Falcon-Konto sammelst du FalCoins – beim Surfen, mit der täglichen Belohnung und mit Missionen.","So verdienst du <span class=\"grad\">FalCoins</span>","Websites besuchen","Für jede Seite, die du besuchst, solange du angemeldet bist.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>+1 pro Besuch","Tägliche Belohnung","Hol dir jeden Tag deine Münzen ab – am 7. Tag in Folge gibt es einen Bonus.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>+10 · +50 Bonus","Missionen","Drei neue Aufgaben jeden Tag, z. B. „Besuche 20 Seiten“ oder „Nutze 30 Minuten Game Mode“.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>bis +45 täglich","Alles im Blick","Der FalCoin-Verlauf zeigt jede Einnahme und jeden Kauf mit Datum.","Transparent","FalCoin-Shop","Alles ist jetzt <span class=\"grad\">kostenlos</span>","Alle Beta-Funktionen sind für alle frei – auch ohne Konto und ohne FalCoins.","Beta-Zugriff <span class=\"tag\" style=\"margin-left:6px\">Für alle kostenlos</span>","Du musst den Beta-Zugriff nicht mehr kaufen: Alle Funktionen daraus gehören jetzt fest zu Falcon.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b> – Hintergrund-Tabs pausieren und schlafen, damit dein Spiel CPU und Arbeitsspeicher bekommt</span>","<svg/><span><b>RGB-Modus</b> – die Akzentfarbe läuft durch alle Farben, Tabs und Knöpfe leuchten</span>","<svg/><span><b>Angebots-Wunschliste</b> – Falcon meldet sich, wenn ein Spiel kostenlos oder reduziert ist</span>","<svg/><span><b>Seite übersetzen</b> – Websites direkt in deine Sprache übersetzen</span>","<svg/><span>Ohne Konto und ohne FalCoins nutzbar</span>","<svg/><span>Mission „30 Minuten Game Mode“ freigeschaltet</span>","<svg/><span>Ohne Ablaufdatum</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Für alle kostenlos","Game Mode","Der Game Mode ist für alle frei – einfach in der Symbolleiste einschalten.","<svg/><span>Hintergrund-Tabs nach 30 Sekunden pausieren</span>","<svg/><span>Später schlafen legen, Animationen aus</span>","<svg/><span>Tabs mit Ton bleiben aktiv</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Für alle kostenlos","<b>FalCoin-Shop</b><span>Im Kontomenü auf deine FalCoins klicken.</span>","<b>Belohnungen &amp; Missionen</b><span>Jeden Tag neu.</span>","Bereit zum <span class=\"grad\">Abheben?</span>","Falcon ist kostenlos, in einer Minute installiert und aktualisiert sich danach selbst im Hintergrund.","<svg/>Kostenlos herunterladen","FalCoin-Shop vergrößern","Der FalCoin-Shop","Belohnungen vergrößern","Tägliche Belohnung und Missionen","Schließen","Vorheriges Bild","Nächstes Bild","FalCoins sammeln beim Surfen, mit der täglichen Belohnung und mit Missionen. Alle Beta-Funktionen von Falcon sind für alle kostenlos.","FAQ – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Start</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funktionen</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\" aria-current=\"page\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Herunterladen</a>","FAQ","Häufige <span class=\"grad\">Fragen</span>","Deine Frage ist nicht dabei? <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">Frag auf GitHub</a> oder nutze in Falcon „Fehler melden“.","Allgemein","Ist Falcon kostenlos?<svg/>","Ja. Falcon ist komplett kostenlos und Open Source (MIT-Lizenz). Es gibt keine Werbung und kein Abo.","Auf welcher Technik basiert Falcon?<svg/>","Falcon basiert auf Chromium – derselben Grundlage wie Chrome, Edge und Opera. Websites funktionieren deshalb genauso wie dort.","Gibt es Falcon für Mac, Linux oder das Handy?<svg/>","Ja. Falcon gibt es für Windows 10 und 11, für macOS (Apple-Chip und Intel) und für Linux (.deb und .rpm) – alles auf der <a href=\"/download\">Download-Seite</a>. Fürs Android-Handy gibt es Falcon Mobile als App. Für iOS-Geräte gibt es Falcon Mobile als .ipa, die du mit dem kostenlosen Programm iloader vom Computer aus installierst (nicht im App Store).","Warum warnt Windows beim Installieren?<svg/>","Falcon ist noch nicht digital signiert, deshalb zeigt Windows SmartScreen eine Warnung. Klick auf <b>Weitere Informationen → Trotzdem ausführen</b>. Den Quellcode kann jeder auf GitHub einsehen.","Wie bekomme ich Updates?<svg/>","Automatisch. Falcon sucht beim Start nach neuen Versionen, lädt sie herunter und installiert sie im Hintergrund – danach startet Falcon einfach neu. Deine Tabs sind wieder da, wenn unter „Beim Start“ die letzte Sitzung gewählt ist (Standard). Ab zwei Versionen Rückstand ist das Update Pflicht: Bis dahin sind dein Falcon-Konto und einige Funktionen gesperrt, danach bist du automatisch wieder angemeldet.","Kann ich Falcon als Standardbrowser festlegen?<svg/>","Ja, unter <b>Einstellungen → Allgemein → Als Standard festlegen</b>. Falcon erscheint außerdem in den Windows-Einstellungen unter <b>Apps → Standard-Apps</b>.","Gaming","Was macht der Game Mode genau?<svg/>","Er pausiert Tabs im Hintergrund nach 30 Sekunden, legt sie später schlafen und schaltet Animationen ab. So bekommt dein Spiel mehr CPU und Arbeitsspeicher. Tabs, die Ton abspielen, bleiben aktiv.","Wie bekomme ich den Game Mode?<svg/>","Einfach einschalten: Der Game Mode ist für alle kostenlos, auch ohne Konto. Klicke auf das Controller-Symbol in der Symbolleiste oder drücke Strg+Umschalt+G.","Ich habe im Shop aus Versehen etwas gekauft – was nun?<svg/>","Öffne den FalCoin-Shop und tippe auf <b>Rückerstattung beantragen</b>. Wähle den Kauf aus, gib deine E-Mail-Adresse und kurz den Grund an. Die Antwort bekommst du beim nächsten Start von Falcon. Wird die Rückerstattung genehmigt, bekommst du deine FalCoins zurück. <b>Wichtig:</b> Für den Beta-Zugriff kannst du eine Rückerstattung nur innerhalb von <b>24 Stunden</b> nach dem Kauf beantragen – danach nicht mehr.","Was bringt der Netzwerk-Limiter?<svg/>","Er begrenzt die Bandbreite von Websites und Downloads, damit dein Spiel genug Leitung für einen stabilen Ping hat – wahlweise immer oder nur im Game Mode.","Laufen Netflix und Disney+?<svg/>","Noch nicht. Diese Dienste brauchen einen Kopierschutz (Widevine), den Falcon im Moment nicht mitbringt.","Konto, Sync &amp; FalCoins","Brauche ich ein Konto?<svg/>","Nein. Falcon funktioniert auch ohne Konto. Ein kostenloses Falcon-Konto brauchst du nur für den Sync zwischen PCs, die Handy-App und FalCoins.","Wie sicher sind meine synchronisierten Daten?<svg/>","Lesezeichen, Passwörter, Verlauf, Einstellungen und Tabs werden auf deinem PC mit AES-256 verschlüsselt, bevor sie hochgeladen werden. Der Schlüssel ist mit deinem Passwort geschützt – der Server sieht nur unlesbare Daten.","Ich habe mein Passwort vergessen – was nun?<svg/>","Unter „Passwort vergessen?“ bekommst du einen Link per E-Mail. Danach entsperrst du deine Sync-Daten einmal mit deinem alten Passwort – oder fängst mit den Daten deines PCs neu an.","Was sind FalCoins?<svg/>","Münzen, die du beim Surfen sammelst: 1 pro Website-Besuch, 10 täglich als Belohnung (mit Bonus am 7. Tag in Folge) und bis zu 45 täglich für Missionen. Für die Funktionen von Falcon brauchst du sie nicht mehr – die sind alle kostenlos.","Erweiterungen &amp; Datenschutz","Funktionieren Chrome-Erweiterungen?<svg/>","Viele ja. Auf jeder Erweiterungsseite im Chrome Web Store erscheint der Knopf <b>„Zu Falcon hinzufügen“</b>. Weil Falcon nur einen Teil der Erweiterungs-Schnittstellen unterstützt, funktionieren manche Erweiterungen nur teilweise.","Sammelt Falcon Daten über mich?<svg/>","Nein. Falcon enthält keine Analyse- oder Werbe-Tracker. Details findest du in der <a href=\"/datenschutz\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">Datenschutzerklärung</a>.","Wie melde ich einen Fehler?<svg/>","In Falcon im Hauptmenü über <b>„Fehler melden …“</b> oder auf <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">GitHub</a>.","Antworten auf häufige Fragen zu Falcon: Kosten, Updates, Game Mode, Sync, FalCoins, Erweiterungen und Datenschutz.","Funktionen – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Start</a><a href=\"/funktionen\" aria-current=\"page\">Funktionen</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Herunterladen</a>","Funktionen","Gebaut für <span class=\"grad\">dein Setup.</span>","Von Game Mode bis Ende-zu-Ende-Verschlüsselung: Das steckt alles in Falcon.","🎮 Gaming","Volle Leistung <span class=\"grad\">fürs Spiel.</span>","Falcon weiß, dass der Browser beim Zocken im Hintergrund läuft – und verhält sich auch so.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b>: pausiert und schläfert Hintergrund-Tabs ein, schaltet Animationen ab</span>","<svg/><span><b>Netzwerk-Limiter</b>: 2 bis 100 Mbit/s, immer oder nur im Game Mode</span>","<svg/><span><b>RAM-Grenze</b>: unbenutzte Tabs schlafen, sobald das Limit erreicht ist</span>","<svg/><span><b>Overlay-Fenster</b>: Stream oder Guide bleibt immer im Vordergrund</span>","<svg/><span><b>Lautstärke pro Tab</b> und Bild-in-Bild für Videos</span>","🧭 Browsen","Zwei Tabs. <span class=\"grad\">Ein Fenster.</span>","Die geteilte Ansicht zeigt zwei Seiten nebeneinander – die Trennlinie lässt sich frei verschieben.","<svg/><span><b>Geteilte Ansicht</b> mit verschiebbarer Trennlinie</span>","<svg/><span><b>Befehlspalette</b> (Strg + K) für Tabs, Lesezeichen und Befehle</span>","<svg/><span><b>Leseansicht</b> (F9) für Artikel ohne Ablenkung</span>","<svg/><span><b>Screenshot-Werkzeug</b>: Bereich, sichtbarer Teil oder ganze Seite</span>","<svg/><span><b>Downloads-Seite</b> mit Suche, Geschwindigkeit und Fortsetzen</span>","🕹️ Startseite","Gratis-Spiele, <span class=\"grad\">direkt auf dem Schirm.</span>","Die Startseite zeigt dir, welche Spiele es gerade kostenlos gibt und welche Angebote sich lohnen – von Steam, Epic Games und GOG.","<svg/><span>Aktuelle <b>Gratis-Spiele</b> mit Restlaufzeit</span>","<svg/><span><b>Angebote</b> mit Rabatt und Preis</span>","<svg/><span>Eigene Verknüpfungen, Uhr und Hintergrundbild</span>","Und noch viel mehr","Kleine Dinge, <span class=\"grad\">die den Unterschied machen.</span>","Werbeblocker","EasyList, EasyPrivacy und mehr – über 150.000 Regeln, wöchentlich aktualisiert. Das Falcon-Schild zeigt, was blockiert wurde. Auch in der Handy-App.","Passwort-Manager","Speichert Logins verschlüsselt, schlägt sichere Passwörter vor und warnt vor Datenlecks und doppelten Passwörtern.","Passkeys","Melde dich mit Windows Hello, deinem iPhone, Android-Handy oder einem Sicherheitsschlüssel an.","Konto &amp; Sync","Lesezeichen, Passwörter, Verlauf, Einstellungen und offene Tabs – Ende-zu-Ende-verschlüsselt.","Handy-App","Falcon für Android und iOS: Tabs, Lesezeichen, Passwörter, Werbeblocker, FalCoins und der Shop – alles wie am PC.","Tab-Vorschau","Fahr mit der Maus über einen Tab und sieh sofort ein kleines Bild der Seite – ohne den Tab zu wechseln.","RGB-Modus","Die Akzentfarbe läuft durch alle Farben, Tabs und Knöpfe leuchten wie deine Gaming-Tastatur.","Angebots-Wunschliste","Merk dir Spiele – Falcon meldet sich, sobald eins kostenlos oder um mindestens 20 % reduziert ist.","Chrome-Erweiterungen","Direkt aus dem Chrome Web Store installieren – mit dem Knopf „Zu Falcon hinzufügen“.","Inkognito-Fenster","Getrennte Sitzung im Arbeitsspeicher: Nach dem Schließen ist alles weg.","Seite übersetzen","Websites direkt in Falcon in deine Sprache übersetzen – ohne Umweg über eine andere Seite. Per Rechtsklick, Strg + K oder im Menü der Handy-App.","5 Sprachen","Deutsch, English, Français, Español und Türkçe – Falcon folgt deiner Systemsprache.","Standardbrowser","Links und HTML-Dateien aus anderen Programmen öffnen sich auf Wunsch in Falcon.","Seitenleiste","Discord, Twitch, Spotify oder jede Web-App immer griffbereit an der Seite.","Unsichtbare Updates","Neue Versionen werden im Hintergrund installiert – Falcon startet einfach neu.","Leistungsanzeige mit Game Mode","Zwei Websites nebeneinander in der geteilten Ansicht","Gratis-Spiele und Angebote auf der Startseite von Falcon","Alle Funktionen von Falcon: Game Mode, Netzwerk-Limiter, geteilte Ansicht, Werbeblocker, Passwort-Manager, Passkeys, verschlüsselter Sync und mehr.","Falcon – Der Browser für Gamer","<a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Start</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funktionen</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Herunterladen</a>","Der Browser, der <span class=\"grad\">für Gamer</span> gebaut ist.","Falcon gibt deinen Spielen CPU, Arbeitsspeicher und Bandbreite zurück – mit Game Mode, Netzwerk-Limiter, eingebautem Werbeblocker und Ende-zu-Ende-verschlüsseltem Sync.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/download\" data-cta=\"\"><svg/><span data-cta-label=\"\">Kostenlos herunterladen</span></a> <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/funktionen\">Alle Funktionen<svg/></a>","<span><svg/>Kostenlos &amp; Open Source</span> <span><svg/>Windows, macOS &amp; Linux</span> <span><svg/>Automatische Updates</span>","<b>150.000+</b><span>Filterregeln gegen Werbung</span>","<b>AES-256</b><span>Ende-zu-Ende-Verschlüsselung</span>","<b>5</b><span>Sprachen</span>","<b>0 €</b><span>für immer kostenlos</span>","Warum Falcon?","Alles, was du brauchst. <span class=\"grad\">Nichts, was bremst.</span>","Falcon basiert auf Chromium – alle Websites funktionieren wie gewohnt. Dazu kommen Funktionen, die andere Browser nicht haben.","Pausiert Hintergrund-Tabs und legt sie schlafen, damit dein Spiel die volle Leistung bekommt.","Netzwerk-Limiter","Begrenzt Downloads und Websites – für einen stabilen Ping, auch wenn nebenbei etwas lädt.","Über 150.000 Filterregeln blockieren Werbung, Tracker und auf Wunsch Cookie-Banner.","Geteilte Ansicht","Guide und Karte, Stream und Chat: zwei Tabs nebeneinander in einem Fenster.","Verschlüsselter Sync","Lesezeichen, Passwörter, Verlauf und Tabs auf all deinen PCs – nur für dich lesbar.","Sammle Münzen beim Surfen, mit der täglichen Belohnung und mit Missionen.","Mehr FPS. <span class=\"grad\">Weniger Ballast.</span>","Ein Klick und Falcon räumt im Hintergrund auf: Tabs, die du gerade nicht brauchst, werden pausiert und später schlafen gelegt. Die Leistungsanzeige zeigt dir live, wie viel CPU und Arbeitsspeicher Falcon gerade braucht.","<svg/><span><b>Pausiert Hintergrund-Tabs</b> nach 30 Sekunden – ohne sie zu schließen</span>","<svg/><span><b>Tabs mit Ton bleiben aktiv</b> – deine Musik läuft weiter</span>","<svg/><span><b>RAM-Grenze</b>: Falcon bleibt unter dem Limit, das du festlegst</span>","<svg/><span><b>Netzwerk-Limiter</b> gleich mit dazu</span>","Produktiv","Alles mit der Tastatur. <span class=\"grad\">Strg + K.</span>","Die Befehlspalette findet offene Tabs, Lesezeichen, deinen Verlauf und jeden Befehl in Falcon – blitzschnell und ohne Maus.","<svg/><span>Tabs wechseln, Game Mode schalten, Einstellungen öffnen</span>","<svg/><span>Tabs von deinen anderen PCs direkt öffnen</span>","<svg/><span>Screenshots mit <b>Strg + Umschalt + S</b></span>","Sicher","Deine Daten gehören <span class=\"grad\">dir.</span>","Mit einem kostenlosen Falcon-Konto sind deine Daten auf jedem PC dabei. Alles wird auf deinem Gerät verschlüsselt, bevor es hochgeladen wird – nicht einmal der Server kann es lesen.","<svg/><span><b>Passwort-Manager</b> mit Generator und Datenleck-Prüfung</span>","<svg/><span><b>Passkeys</b> mit iPhone, Android oder Sicherheitsschlüssel</span>","<svg/><span><b>Handy-App</b> für Android und iOS mit Tabs, Passwörtern, FalCoins und Shop</span>","Die Startseite von Falcon mit Verknüpfungen und aktuellen Gratis-Spielen","Die Leistungsanzeige von Falcon mit eingeschaltetem Game Mode","Die Befehlspalette von Falcon","Das Kontomenü von Falcon mit FalCoins und Sync-Status","Falcon ist ein schneller, kostenloser Browser für Gamer: Game Mode, Netzwerk-Limiter, Werbeblocker, geteilte Ansicht und Ende-zu-Ende-verschlüsselter Sync.","Screenshots – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Start</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funktionen</a><a href=\"/screenshots\" aria-current=\"page\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Herunterladen</a>","Screenshots","So sieht <span class=\"grad\">Falcon</span> aus.","Dunkel, aufgeräumt und schnell. Klick auf ein Bild, um es groß anzusehen.","<b>Startseite</b><span>Verknüpfungen, Suche und die aktuellen Gratis-Spiele.</span>","<b>Leistung &amp; Game Mode</b><span>CPU und Arbeitsspeicher live – Game Mode mit einem Klick.</span>","<b>Geteilte Ansicht</b><span>Zwei Seiten nebeneinander, Trennlinie frei verschiebbar.</span>","<b>Befehlspalette</b><span>Tabs, Lesezeichen und Befehle mit Strg + K.</span>","<b>Gratis-Spiele &amp; Angebote</b><span>Kostenlose Spiele und Rabatte von Steam, Epic und GOG.</span>","<b>Konto &amp; FalCoins</b><span>Sync-Status, FalCoins und Missionen im Kontomenü.</span>","<b>FalCoin-Shop</b><span>Dein Guthaben und alle Artikel auf einen Blick.</span>","<b>Belohnungen &amp; Missionen</b><span>Tägliche Belohnung mit Serien-Bonus und Missionen.</span>","Startseite vergrößern","Startseite","Leistung & Game Mode vergrößern","Leistung & Game Mode","Geteilte Ansicht vergrößern","Befehlspalette vergrößern","Befehlspalette","Gratis-Spiele & Angebote vergrößern","Gratis-Spiele & Angebote","Konto & FalCoins vergrößern","Konto & FalCoins","Belohnungen & Missionen vergrößern","Belohnungen & Missionen","Screenshots von Falcon: Startseite, Game Mode, geteilte Ansicht, Befehlspalette, Gratis-Spiele, FalCoin-Shop und mehr.","Version {v}","Neueste Version","Neueste Version auf GitHub","Noch keine Version veröffentlicht","Bald verfügbar","Erscheint mit dem nächsten Release","{a} und {b}","<b>Die neue Version wird für den Download vorbereitet.</b> Falcon {v} für {p} ist in den nächsten Minuten verfügbar.","Zum Download","Version {v} wird gerade für den Download vorbereitet. Bis dahin bekommst du Version {o} – sie aktualisiert sich danach automatisch.","Version {v} wird gerade für den Download vorbereitet. Bis dahin bekommst du die bisherige Version – sie aktualisiert sich danach automatisch.","Version {v} für {p} wird gerade für den Download vorbereitet. Das dauert noch einige Minuten.","Die neue Android-Version wird gerade für den Download vorbereitet. Bis dahin bekommst du Version {o}.","Die neue Android-Version wird gerade für den Download vorbereitet. Bis dahin bekommst du die bisherige.","Android-Handy","Android-Tablet","Linux-PC","Apple-Chip","Kostenlos herunterladen","App für Android herunterladen","Für iOS-Geräte herunterladen","Für macOS herunterladen","Für Linux herunterladen","Erkannt: {d}","Wähle deine Plattform","Neu","Aus dem <a>Changelog</a> (englisch).","Alle Änderungen findest du im <a>Changelog auf GitHub</a>.","Sprache","<b>Falcon {v} für {p} wird für den Download vorbereitet.</b> Das dauert noch einige Minuten – {r} sind schon da.","<b>Falcon {v} für {p} wird für den Download vorbereitet.</b> Das dauert noch einige Minuten – {r} ist schon da.","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">Neueste Version wird geladen …</span>","Dein Gerät wird erkannt …","<b>Falcon für Windows</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">Neueste Version wird geladen …</span>","<b>Falcon für Android</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">Neueste Version wird geladen …</span>","Neuerungen werden geladen …","<svg/><span><b>Akzentfarbe</b> – Falcon in deiner Farbe, auch mit eigenen Farben</span>"],"en":["Page not found – Falcon","Skip to content","<img src=\"/assets/logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Features</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Download</a>","<svg/>Download","Error 404","This page has <span class=\"grad\">flown away.</span>","This address doesn’t exist (anymore). Maybe one of these links helps.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/\">Go to home page</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Download</a>","The fast, focused browser for gamers. Free and open source.","Falcon","<a href=\"/funktionen\">Features</a>","<a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a>","<a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a>","<a href=\"/download\">Download</a>","Help","<a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Report a problem</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Changelog</a>","Project","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>","<a href=\"/datenschutz\">Privacy</a>","<span>© <span data-year=\"\">2026</span> Falcon · MIT License</span> <span>Current version <span data-version=\"\">…</span></span>","Falcon – Home","Main menu","Open menu","This page doesn’t exist.","Privacy – Falcon","Legal","Privacy","How this website and the Falcon browser handle your data.","In short: this website sets no cookies, uses no analytics or advertising trackers and loads no fonts or scripts from third parties. The Falcon browser contains no trackers either; synced data is end-to-end encrypted.","1. Controller","Responsible for this website and the Falcon browser is Calvin, the developer of Falcon.","You can ask privacy questions via the <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">issues on GitHub</a> or via “Report a problem” in Falcon.","2. This website","Hosting at Vercel","This website is hosted by Vercel Inc., 440 N Barranca Ave #4133, Covina, CA 91723, USA. When you visit it, Vercel processes technically necessary data such as your IP address, date and time, the page requested, browser and operating system in order to deliver the page and protect it from attacks. The legal basis is our legitimate interest in secure and stable operation (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Vercel is certified under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework; more in <a href=\"https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vercel’s privacy policy</a>.","Current version from GitHub","So that the download button, version number and release notes are always up to date, your browser fetches public information from GitHub when you visit this website (<code>api.github.com</code>, <code>raw.githubusercontent.com</code>). Your IP address is transmitted to GitHub Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA. The download itself is also served by GitHub. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. See also <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/de/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub’s privacy policy</a>.","Cookies and local storage","This website sets no cookies. The version number it fetches and your chosen language are stored in your browser’s local storage so the page loads faster; you can delete them at any time in your browser settings.","3. The Falcon browser","Falcon works without an account. Bookmarks, history and settings then stay on your PC. Saved passwords are protected with your operating system’s encryption.","Falcon account, sync and FalCoins","If you create a Falcon account, sign-in and data storage are handled by Google Firebase (Google Ireland Ltd., Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland). We store your email address, your display name, your FalCoin balance, purchased unlocks, mission progress and your FalCoin history.","Bookmarks, passwords, history, settings and open tabs are <b>encrypted on your device before they are uploaded</b> (AES-256-GCM). The key is protected by your password; neither Firebase nor the developer can read this data. The legal basis is providing the account features (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR). You can delete your account and all its data at any time in Falcon under <b>Settings → Account &amp; Sync → Delete account</b>.","Problem reports","If you report a problem in Falcon, the description, type of report, Falcon version and date are stored. The description can be viewed anonymously by all Falcon users at <code>falcon://reports</code> – please don’t include personal information. Email address, page address, screenshot and operating system are optional and only visible to the developer.","Other services","<b>Updates:</b> Falcon asks GitHub for new versions.","<b>Free games &amp; deals</b> on the start page come from GamerPower and CheapShark (can be turned off).","<b>Website icons</b> (favicons) are loaded via a Google service.","<b>Ad blocker:</b> filter lists are downloaded once a week from public sources.","<b>Password check:</b> only the first 5 characters of a hash are sent to “Have I Been Pwned” – never the password itself.","<b>Translate page</b> sends the page’s text to Google Translate.","<b>Extensions</b> are loaded from Google’s Chrome Web Store.","4. Your rights","You have the right of access (Art. 15 GDPR), rectification (Art. 16), erasure (Art. 17), restriction of processing (Art. 18), data portability (Art. 20) and to object to processing based on legitimate interests (Art. 21). You can also lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority (Art. 77 GDPR).","5. Changes","This privacy policy is updated when Falcon or this website changes. Last updated: November 2026.","Privacy policy for falconbrowser.de and the Falcon browser.","Download – Falcon","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">Latest version</span>","Download <span class=\"grad\">Falcon</span>","Free, ad-free and open source. After installing, Falcon keeps itself up to date.","Detected: Windows PC · Windows 11","<span class=\"dl-select-ic\" data-platform-icon=\"\"><svg/></span> <span class=\"dl-select-label\">Version for</span> <b data-platform-current=\"\">Windows PC</b> <svg/>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Windows PC</b><small>Windows 10 and 11</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Android</b><small>Phone and tablet, APK</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>iOS devices</b><small>.ipa</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>macOS</b><small>Apple chip and Intel</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Linux</b><small>.deb and .rpm</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","Windows PC","Android","iOS devices","macOS","Linux","<b>Falcon for Windows</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">Latest version on GitHub</span>","<svg/>Download for Windows","Windows 10 and 11 (64-bit) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Older versions</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Source code</a>","<b>Falcon for Android</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">Latest version on GitHub</span>","<svg/><span data-apk-label=\"\">Download for Android</span>","Android 7 or later · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Older versions</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Source code</a>","<b>Falcon for macOS</b><span data-mac-meta=\"\">Loading latest version …</span>","<svg/><span>For Macs with Apple chip (M1–M4)</span>","<svg/><span>For Macs with Intel processor</span>","macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Older versions</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Source code</a>","<b>Falcon for Linux</b><span data-linux-meta=\"\">Loading latest version …</span>","<svg/><span>.deb – Ubuntu, Debian, Mint</span>","<svg/><span>.rpm – Fedora, openSUSE</span>","64-bit (x86_64) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Older versions</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Source code</a>","<b>Falcon for iOS devices</b><span data-ios-meta=\"\">Loading latest version …</span>","<svg/><span>Download .ipa</span>","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 or later · Install with <a href=\"https://github.com/nab138/iloader/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iloader</a> (Windows, macOS, Linux) · Without installing: <a href=\"/app\">Falcon web app</a>","<b data-soon-title=\"\">Coming soon</b><span>In preparation</span>","Go to the Falcon web app","You can pick a different version above at any time.","Ready in three steps","Download the installer","Click “Download for Windows” above. The file is called <code>Falcon-Setup-<span data-version=\"\">…</span>.exe</code>.","Run the installer","If Windows shows “Windows protected your PC”, click <b>More info → Run anyway</b>. Falcon isn’t digitally signed yet.","Get started","Falcon starts right away. You can import bookmarks and passwords from Chrome, Edge, Opera or Firefox.","Falcon on your Android phone","Download the APK","Open this page on your phone and tap “Download for Android” above. The file is called <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-apk-version=\"\">…</span>.apk</code>.","Allow installation","Android asks whether your browser may install apps. Tap <b>Settings → Allow from this source</b>, then <b>Install</b>. Falcon isn’t on the Play Store yet.","Sign in","Sign in with your Falcon account – or create one right in the app. Your bookmarks, passwords, history and FalCoins are then the same on your phone and PC.","Falcon on your Mac","Download the DMG","Pick your Mac above: <b>Apple chip</b> (M1, M2, M3, M4) or <b>Intel</b>. You can see which one you have under  → <b>About This Mac</b>.","Drag to “Applications”","Open the downloaded file and drag Falcon into the <b>Applications</b> folder.","Allow it on first launch","Falcon isn’t signed by Apple yet. Right-click Falcon in the Applications folder → <b>Open</b> → <b>Open</b>. If macOS says the app is “damaged”, run <code>xattr -cr /Applications/Falcon.app</code> in Terminal and start Falcon again.","Falcon on Linux","Choose a package","<b>.deb</b> for Ubuntu, Debian, Linux Mint, Pop!_OS · <b>.rpm</b> for Fedora, openSUSE, RHEL.","Install","Double-clicking the file opens your software manager. In the terminal: <code>sudo apt install ./Falcon-*.deb</code> or <code>sudo dnf install ./Falcon-*.rpm</code>.","You’ll then find Falcon in your applications menu. Falcon updates itself in the background, just like on Windows.","Falcon on iOS devices","Falcon isn’t on the App Store. You install the .ipa from your computer with the free program <b>iloader</b> – on Windows, macOS or Linux, with your regular Apple ID.","Download iloader","Download iloader for free from <b>github.com/nab138/iloader</b> under “Releases” (or from <b>iloader.app</b> – only these two sources are official). Windows: <code>iloader-windows-x64.msi</code>, macOS: <code>iloader-darwin-universal.dmg</code>, Linux: <code>.deb</code>, <code>.rpm</code> or <code>.AppImage</code>. The “Sponsor” button on GitHub is just an optional donation.","So your computer recognizes the device","<b>Windows:</b> also install <b>iTunes</b> from Apple. <b>macOS:</b> nothing needed. <b>Linux:</b> install <code>usbmuxd</code> if it’s missing (Debian/Ubuntu: <code>sudo apt install usbmuxd</code>).","Download the .ipa to your computer","Download the file <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-ios-version=\"\">…</span>.ipa</code> above to your computer.","Connect your device","Connect your iPhone or iPad with a <b>data cable</b>, unlock it and tap “Trust”. If you don’t get a “Trust” prompt and the device only charges, try a different cable or USB port.","Sign in to iloader","Open iloader and sign in with your Apple ID (a free one is enough). If signing in fails, choose “Reset Anisette State” in iloader’s settings and restart iloader.","Install Falcon","In iloader, select your device, then <b>“Import IPA”</b> and the Falcon .ipa. iloader signs Falcon with your Apple ID and installs it on the device.","Allow it on the device","Turn on Developer Mode under <b>Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Developer Mode</b> (the option only appears after installing, then restart) and trust your Apple ID under <b>Settings → General → VPN &amp; Device Management</b>. Falcon will then start.","Reinstall every 7 days","With a free Apple ID the signature expires after 7 days. Then connect the device again and reinstall Falcon with iloader – your data is kept. You install new Falcon versions the same way.","What’s new?","What’s new","You can find all changes in the <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">changelog on GitHub</a>.","System requirements","Windows","Windows 10 or 11, 64-bit","macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later, Apple chip or Intel","64-bit, e.g. Ubuntu 20.04+, Debian 11+, Fedora 36+ (.deb or .rpm)","Memory","4 GB (8 GB recommended)","Disk space","about 400 MB","Android 7.0 or later","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 or later, installed with iloader on a computer (Windows, macOS or Linux)","Falcon logo","Choose platform","Platform","Download Falcon for free for Windows, macOS, Linux, Android and iOS. Automatic updates, no ads, open source.","FalCoins – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Features</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\" aria-current=\"page\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Download</a>","FalCoins","Browsing now pays off <span class=\"grad\">twice.</span>","With a free Falcon account you collect FalCoins – while browsing, with the daily reward and with missions.","How to earn <span class=\"grad\">FalCoins</span>","Visit websites","For every page you visit while signed in.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>+1 per visit","Daily reward","Collect your coins every day – on the 7th day in a row you get a bonus.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>+10 · +50 bonus","Missions","Three new tasks every day, e.g. “Visit 20 pages” or “Use Game Mode for 30 minutes”.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>up to +45 daily","Keep track of everything","The FalCoin history shows every coin earned and every purchase with its date.","Transparent","FalCoin shop","Everything is <span class=\"grad\">free</span> now","All beta features are free for everyone – even without an account and without FalCoins.","Beta access <span class=\"tag\" style=\"margin-left:6px\">Free for everyone</span>","You no longer need to buy beta access: all of its features are now a regular part of Falcon.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b> – pauses and sleeps background tabs so your game gets CPU and memory</span>","<svg/><span><b>RGB mode</b> – the accent colour cycles through every colour, tabs and buttons glow</span>","<svg/><span><b>Deal wishlist</b> – Falcon lets you know when a game is free or on sale</span>","<svg/><span><b>Translate page</b> – translate websites into your language right in Falcon</span>","<svg/><span>Works without an account and without FalCoins</span>","<svg/><span>Unlocks the “30 minutes of Game Mode” mission</span>","<svg/><span>No expiry date</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Free for everyone","Game Mode","Game Mode is free for everyone – just turn it on in the toolbar.","<svg/><span>Pauses background tabs after 30 seconds</span>","<svg/><span>Puts them to sleep later, turns off animations</span>","<svg/><span>Tabs playing sound stay active</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Free for everyone","<b>FalCoin shop</b><span>Click your FalCoins in the account menu.</span>","<b>Rewards &amp; missions</b><span>New every day.</span>","Ready for <span class=\"grad\">takeoff?</span>","Falcon is free, installed in a minute and then updates itself in the background.","<svg/>Download for free","Enlarge FalCoin shop","The FalCoin shop","Enlarge rewards","Daily reward and missions","Close","Previous image","Next image","Collect FalCoins while browsing, with the daily reward and with missions. All beta features of Falcon are free for everyone.","FAQ – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Features</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\" aria-current=\"page\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Download</a>","FAQ","Frequently asked <span class=\"grad\">questions</span>","Your question isn’t here? <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">Ask on GitHub</a> or use “Report a problem” in Falcon.","General","Is Falcon free?<svg/>","Yes. Falcon is completely free and open source (MIT license). There are no ads and no subscription.","What technology is Falcon based on?<svg/>","Falcon is based on Chromium – the same foundation as Chrome, Edge and Opera. Websites therefore work exactly the same as there.","Is Falcon available for Mac, Linux or phones?<svg/>","Yes. Falcon is available for Windows 10 and 11, for macOS (Apple chip and Intel) and for Linux (.deb and .rpm) – all on the <a href=\"/download\">download page</a>. For Android phones there’s the Falcon Mobile app. For iOS devices, Falcon Mobile comes as an .ipa that you install from your computer with the free program iloader (not on the App Store).","Why does Windows show a warning when installing?<svg/>","Falcon isn’t digitally signed yet, so Windows SmartScreen shows a warning. Click <b>More info → Run anyway</b>. Anyone can review the source code on GitHub.","How do I get updates?<svg/>","Automatically. Falcon checks for new versions at startup, downloads them and installs them in the background – then Falcon simply restarts. Your tabs come back if “On startup” is set to last session (the default). If you’re two or more versions behind, the update is required: until then your Falcon account and some features are locked; afterwards you’re signed in again automatically.","Can I make Falcon my default browser?<svg/>","Yes, under <b>Settings → General → Set as default</b>. Falcon also appears in the Windows settings under <b>Apps → Default apps</b>.","Gaming","What exactly does Game Mode do?<svg/>","It pauses background tabs after 30 seconds, puts them to sleep later and turns off animations. That gives your game more CPU and memory. Tabs playing sound stay active.","How do I get Game Mode?<svg/>","Just turn it on: Game Mode is free for everyone, even without an account. Click the controller icon in the toolbar or press Ctrl+Shift+G.","I bought something in the shop by mistake – what now?<svg/>","Open the FalCoin shop and tap <b>Request a refund</b>. Choose the purchase and enter your email address and a short reason. You’ll get the answer the next time you start Falcon. If the refund is approved, you get your FalCoins back. <b>Important:</b> for beta access you can only request a refund within <b>24 hours</b> of purchase – not after that.","What does the network limiter do?<svg/>","It limits the bandwidth of websites and downloads so your game has enough connection for a stable ping – either always or only in Game Mode.","Do Netflix and Disney+ work?<svg/>","Not yet. These services need copy protection (Widevine), which Falcon doesn’t include at the moment.","Account, sync &amp; FalCoins","Do I need an account?<svg/>","No. Falcon also works without an account. You only need a free Falcon account for syncing between PCs, the phone app and FalCoins.","How secure is my synced data?<svg/>","Bookmarks, passwords, history, settings and tabs are encrypted on your PC with AES-256 before they’re uploaded. The key is protected by your password – the server only sees unreadable data.","I forgot my password – what now?<svg/>","Under “Forgot password?” you get a link by email. Afterwards you unlock your sync data once with your old password – or start fresh with your PC’s data.","What are FalCoins?<svg/>","Coins you collect while browsing: 1 per website visit, 10 daily as a reward (with a bonus on the 7th day in a row) and up to 45 daily for missions. You no longer need them for Falcon’s features – those are all free.","Extensions &amp; privacy","Do Chrome extensions work?<svg/>","Many do. On every extension page in the Chrome Web Store you’ll see the <b>“Add to Falcon”</b> button. Because Falcon only supports part of the extension APIs, some extensions only work partially.","Does Falcon collect data about me?<svg/>","No. Falcon contains no analytics or advertising trackers. Details are in the <a href=\"/datenschutz\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">privacy policy</a>.","How do I report a problem?<svg/>","In Falcon via <b>“Report a problem …”</b> in the main menu, or on <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">GitHub</a>.","Answers to frequently asked questions about Falcon: cost, updates, Game Mode, sync, FalCoins, extensions and privacy.","Features – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/funktionen\" aria-current=\"page\">Features</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Download</a>","Features","Built for <span class=\"grad\">your setup.</span>","From Game Mode to end-to-end encryption: here’s everything inside Falcon.","🎮 Gaming","Full power <span class=\"grad\">for your game.</span>","Falcon knows the browser runs in the background while you play – and behaves accordingly.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b>: pauses and sleeps background tabs, turns off animations</span>","<svg/><span><b>Network limiter</b>: 2 to 100 Mbit/s, always or only in Game Mode</span>","<svg/><span><b>RAM limit</b>: unused tabs go to sleep once the limit is reached</span>","<svg/><span><b>Overlay window</b>: your stream or guide always stays on top</span>","<svg/><span><b>Volume per tab</b> and picture-in-picture for videos</span>","🧭 Browsing","Two tabs. <span class=\"grad\">One window.</span>","Split view shows two pages side by side – the divider can be moved freely.","<svg/><span><b>Split view</b> with a movable divider</span>","<svg/><span><b>Command palette</b> (Ctrl + K) for tabs, bookmarks and commands</span>","<svg/><span><b>Reader view</b> (F9) for distraction-free articles</span>","<svg/><span><b>Screenshot tool</b>: area, visible part or full page</span>","<svg/><span><b>Downloads page</b> with search, speed and resume</span>","🕹️ Start page","Free games, <span class=\"grad\">right on screen.</span>","The start page shows you which games are free right now and which deals are worth it – from Steam, Epic Games and GOG.","<svg/><span>Current <b>free games</b> with time remaining</span>","<svg/><span><b>Deals</b> with discount and price</span>","<svg/><span>Your own shortcuts, clock and background image</span>","And much more","Little things <span class=\"grad\">that make the difference.</span>","Ad blocker","EasyList, EasyPrivacy and more – over 150,000 rules, updated weekly. The Falcon shield shows what was blocked. Also in the phone app.","Password manager","Saves logins encrypted, suggests strong passwords and warns about data breaches and reused passwords.","Passkeys","Sign in with Windows Hello, your iPhone, Android phone or a security key.","Account &amp; sync","Bookmarks, passwords, history, settings and open tabs – end-to-end encrypted.","Phone app","Falcon for Android and iOS: tabs, bookmarks, passwords, ad blocker, FalCoins and the shop – just like on your PC.","Tab preview","Hover over a tab and instantly see a small picture of the page – without switching tabs.","RGB mode","The accent colour cycles through every colour, tabs and buttons glow like your gaming keyboard.","Deal wishlist","Save games – Falcon lets you know as soon as one is free or at least 20% off.","Chrome extensions","Install straight from the Chrome Web Store – with the “Add to Falcon” button.","Incognito windows","A separate session in memory: once closed, everything is gone.","Translate page","Translate websites into your language right in Falcon – without detours via another site. Via right-click, Ctrl + K or the menu in the phone app.","5 languages","Deutsch, English, Français, Español and Türkçe – Falcon follows your system language.","Default browser","Links and HTML files from other programs open in Falcon if you want.","Sidebar","Discord, Twitch, Spotify or any web app always at hand on the side.","Invisible updates","New versions are installed in the background – Falcon simply restarts.","Performance monitor with Game Mode","Two websites side by side in split view","Free games and deals on Falcon’s start page","All of Falcon’s features: Game Mode, network limiter, split view, ad blocker, password manager, passkeys, encrypted sync and more.","Falcon – The browser for gamers","<a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Features</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Download</a>","The browser built <span class=\"grad\">for gamers</span>.","Falcon gives your games back CPU, memory and bandwidth – with Game Mode, a network limiter, a built-in ad blocker and end-to-end encrypted sync.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/download\" data-cta=\"\"><svg/><span data-cta-label=\"\">Download for free</span></a> <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/funktionen\">All features<svg/></a>","<span><svg/>Free &amp; open source</span> <span><svg/>Windows, macOS &amp; Linux</span> <span><svg/>Automatic updates</span>","<b>150,000+</b><span>filter rules against ads</span>","<b>AES-256</b><span>end-to-end encryption</span>","<b>5</b><span>languages</span>","<b>$0</b><span>free forever</span>","Why Falcon?","Everything you need. <span class=\"grad\">Nothing that slows you down.</span>","Falcon is based on Chromium – every website works as usual. On top come features other browsers don’t have.","Pauses background tabs and puts them to sleep so your game gets full power.","Network limiter","Limits downloads and websites – for a stable ping, even when something is loading in the background.","Over 150,000 filter rules block ads, trackers and, if you like, cookie banners.","Split view","Guide and map, stream and chat: two tabs side by side in one window.","Encrypted sync","Bookmarks, passwords, history and tabs on all your PCs – readable only by you.","Collect coins while browsing, with the daily reward and with missions.","More FPS. <span class=\"grad\">Less clutter.</span>","One click and Falcon tidies up in the background: tabs you don’t need right now are paused and later put to sleep. The performance monitor shows you live how much CPU and memory Falcon is using.","<svg/><span><b>Pauses background tabs</b> after 30 seconds – without closing them</span>","<svg/><span><b>Tabs playing sound stay active</b> – your music keeps playing</span>","<svg/><span><b>RAM limit</b>: Falcon stays below the limit you set</span>","<svg/><span><b>Network limiter</b> included too</span>","Productive","Everything from the keyboard. <span class=\"grad\">Ctrl + K.</span>","The command palette finds open tabs, bookmarks, your history and every command in Falcon – lightning fast and without a mouse.","<svg/><span>Switch tabs, toggle Game Mode, open settings</span>","<svg/><span>Open tabs from your other PCs directly</span>","<svg/><span>Screenshots with <b>Ctrl + Shift + S</b></span>","Secure","Your data belongs to <span class=\"grad\">you.</span>","With a free Falcon account your data comes with you to every PC. Everything is encrypted on your device before it’s uploaded – not even the server can read it.","<svg/><span><b>Password manager</b> with generator and breach check</span>","<svg/><span><b>Passkeys</b> with iPhone, Android or a security key</span>","<svg/><span><b>Phone app</b> for Android and iOS with tabs, passwords, FalCoins and shop</span>","Falcon’s start page with shortcuts and current free games","Falcon’s performance monitor with Game Mode turned on","Falcon’s command palette","Falcon’s account menu with FalCoins and sync status","Falcon is a fast, free browser for gamers: Game Mode, network limiter, ad blocker, split view and end-to-end encrypted sync.","Screenshots – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Features</a><a href=\"/screenshots\" aria-current=\"page\">Screenshots</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Download</a>","Screenshots","This is what <span class=\"grad\">Falcon</span> looks like.","Dark, tidy and fast. Click an image to view it full size.","<b>Start page</b><span>Shortcuts, search and the current free games.</span>","<b>Performance &amp; Game Mode</b><span>CPU and memory live – Game Mode with one click.</span>","<b>Split view</b><span>Two pages side by side, divider freely movable.</span>","<b>Command palette</b><span>Tabs, bookmarks and commands with Ctrl + K.</span>","<b>Free games &amp; deals</b><span>Free games and discounts from Steam, Epic and GOG.</span>","<b>Account &amp; FalCoins</b><span>Sync status, FalCoins and missions in the account menu.</span>","<b>FalCoin shop</b><span>Your balance and all items at a glance.</span>","<b>Rewards &amp; missions</b><span>Daily reward with streak bonus and missions.</span>","Enlarge start page","Start page","Enlarge Performance & Game Mode","Performance & Game Mode","Enlarge split view","Enlarge command palette","Command palette","Enlarge free games & deals","Free games & deals","Enlarge account & FalCoins","Account & FalCoins","Enlarge rewards & missions","Rewards & missions","Screenshots of Falcon: start page, Game Mode, split view, command palette, free games, FalCoin shop and more.","Version {v}","Latest version","Latest version on GitHub","No version released yet","Coming soon","Coming with the next release","{a} and {b}","<b>The new version is being prepared for download.</b> Falcon {v} for {p} will be available in the next few minutes.","Go to download","Version {v} is being prepared for download. Until then you get version {o} – it updates itself automatically afterwards.","Version {v} is being prepared for download. Until then you get the previous version – it updates itself automatically afterwards.","Version {v} for {p} is being prepared for download. This takes a few more minutes.","The new Android version is being prepared for download. Until then you get version {o}.","The new Android version is being prepared for download. Until then you get the previous one.","Android phone","Android tablet","Linux PC","Apple chip","Download for free","Download the Android app","Download for iOS devices","Download for macOS","Download for Linux","Detected: {d}","Choose your platform","New","From the <a>changelog</a>.","You can find all changes in the <a>changelog on GitHub</a>.","Language","<b>Falcon {v} for {p} is being prepared for download.</b> This takes a few more minutes – {r} are already available.","<b>Falcon {v} for {p} is being prepared for download.</b> This takes a few more minutes – {r} is already available.","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">Loading latest version …</span>","Detecting your device …","<b>Falcon for Windows</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">Loading latest version …</span>","<b>Falcon for Android</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">Loading latest version …</span>","Loading what’s new …","<svg/><span><b>Accent colour</b> – Falcon in your colour, including custom colours</span>"],"fr":["Page introuvable – Falcon","Aller au contenu","<img src=\"/assets/logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Accueil</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Fonctionnalités</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Captures</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Télécharger</a>","<svg/>Télécharger","Erreur 404","Cette page s’est <span class=\"grad\">envolée.</span>","Cette adresse n’existe pas (ou plus). L’un de ces liens t’aidera peut-être.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/\">Vers l’accueil</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Télécharger</a>","Le navigateur rapide et épuré pour les gamers. Gratuit et open source.","Falcon","<a href=\"/funktionen\">Fonctionnalités</a>","<a href=\"/screenshots\">Captures</a>","<a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a>","<a href=\"/download\">Télécharger</a>","Aide","<a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Signaler un problème</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Notes de version</a>","Projet","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>","<a href=\"/datenschutz\">Confidentialité</a>","<span>© <span data-year=\"\">2026</span> Falcon · Licence MIT</span> <span>Version actuelle <span data-version=\"\">…</span></span>","Falcon – Accueil","Menu principal","Ouvrir le menu","Cette page n’existe pas.","Confidentialité – Falcon","Mentions légales","Confidentialité","Comment ce site et le navigateur Falcon traitent tes données.","En bref : ce site ne dépose aucun cookie, n’utilise aucun traceur d’analyse ou publicitaire et ne charge ni polices ni scripts de tiers. Le navigateur Falcon ne contient pas non plus de traceurs ; les données synchronisées sont chiffrées de bout en bout.","1. Responsable","Le responsable de ce site et du navigateur Falcon est Calvin, le développeur de Falcon.","Tu peux poser tes questions sur la confidentialité via les <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">issues sur GitHub</a> ou via « Signaler un problème » dans Falcon.","2. Ce site","Hébergement chez Vercel","Ce site est hébergé par Vercel Inc., 440 N Barranca Ave #4133, Covina, CA 91723, États-Unis. Lors de ta visite, Vercel traite des données techniquement nécessaires comme l’adresse IP, la date et l’heure, la page consultée, le navigateur et le système d’exploitation afin de fournir la page et de la protéger contre les attaques. La base légale est notre intérêt légitime à un fonctionnement sûr et stable (art. 6, par. 1, point f du RGPD). Vercel est certifié selon le EU-US Data Privacy Framework ; plus d’infos dans la <a href=\"https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">politique de confidentialité de Vercel</a>.","Version actuelle depuis GitHub","Pour que le bouton de téléchargement, le numéro de version et les nouveautés soient toujours à jour, ton navigateur récupère des informations publiques sur GitHub lors de ta visite (<code>api.github.com</code>, <code>raw.githubusercontent.com</code>). Ton adresse IP est alors transmise à GitHub Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, États-Unis. Le téléchargement lui-même passe aussi par GitHub. La base légale est l’art. 6, par. 1, point f du RGPD. Voir aussi la <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/de/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">politique de confidentialité de GitHub</a>.","Cookies et stockage local","Ce site ne dépose aucun cookie. Le numéro de version récupéré et la langue choisie sont enregistrés dans le stockage local de ton navigateur pour que la page se charge plus vite ; tu peux les supprimer à tout moment dans les réglages de ton navigateur.","3. Le navigateur Falcon","Falcon fonctionne sans compte. Les favoris, l’historique et les réglages restent alors sur ton PC. Les mots de passe enregistrés sont protégés par le chiffrement de ton système d’exploitation.","Compte Falcon, synchronisation et FalCoins","Si tu crées un compte Falcon, la connexion et le stockage des données passent par Google Firebase (Google Ireland Ltd., Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Irlande). Sont enregistrés ton adresse e-mail, ton nom d’affichage, ton solde de FalCoins, les déblocages achetés, la progression des missions et l’historique des FalCoins.","Les favoris, mots de passe, l’historique, les réglages et les onglets ouverts sont <b>chiffrés sur ton appareil avant l’envoi</b> (AES-256-GCM). La clé est protégée par ton mot de passe ; ni Firebase ni le développeur ne peuvent lire ces données. La base légale est l’exécution des fonctions du compte (art. 6, par. 1, point b du RGPD). Tu peux supprimer ton compte et toutes ses données à tout moment dans Falcon sous <b>Réglages → Compte &amp; synchro → Supprimer le compte</b>.","Signalements de problèmes","Si tu signales un problème dans Falcon, la description, le type de signalement, la version de Falcon et la date sont enregistrés. La description est visible anonymement par tous les utilisateurs de Falcon sur <code>falcon://reports</code> – n’y indique aucune information personnelle. L’adresse e-mail, l’adresse de la page, la capture d’écran et le système d’exploitation sont facultatifs et visibles uniquement par le développeur.","Autres services","<b>Mises à jour :</b> Falcon demande à GitHub s’il existe de nouvelles versions.","<b>Jeux gratuits &amp; promos</b> sur la page d’accueil proviennent de GamerPower et CheapShark (désactivable).","<b>Icônes des sites</b> (favicons) sont chargées via un service de Google.","<b>Bloqueur de pubs :</b> les listes de filtres sont téléchargées une fois par semaine depuis des sources publiques.","<b>Vérification des mots de passe :</b> seuls les 5 premiers caractères d’un hash sont envoyés à « Have I Been Pwned » – jamais le mot de passe lui-même.","<b>Traduire la page</b> envoie le texte de la page à Google Traduction.","<b>Les extensions</b> sont chargées depuis le Chrome Web Store de Google.","4. Tes droits","Tu as le droit d’accès (art. 15 RGPD), de rectification (art. 16), d’effacement (art. 17), de limitation du traitement (art. 18), à la portabilité des données (art. 20) et d’opposition aux traitements fondés sur l’intérêt légitime (art. 21). Tu peux aussi déposer une plainte auprès d’une autorité de protection des données (art. 77 RGPD).","5. Modifications","Cette politique de confidentialité est mise à jour lorsque Falcon ou ce site changent. Dernière mise à jour : novembre 2026.","Politique de confidentialité de falconbrowser.de et du navigateur Falcon.","Télécharger – Falcon","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">Dernière version</span>","Télécharger <span class=\"grad\">Falcon</span>","Gratuit, sans pub et open source. Après l’installation, Falcon se met à jour tout seul.","Détecté : PC Windows · Windows 11","<span class=\"dl-select-ic\" data-platform-icon=\"\"><svg/></span> <span class=\"dl-select-label\">Version pour</span> <b data-platform-current=\"\">PC Windows</b> <svg/>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>PC Windows</b><small>Windows 10 et 11</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Android</b><small>Téléphone et tablette, APK</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Appareils iOS</b><small>.ipa</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>macOS</b><small>Puce Apple et Intel</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Linux</b><small>.deb et .rpm</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","PC Windows","Android","Appareils iOS","macOS","Linux","<b>Falcon pour Windows</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">Dernière version sur GitHub</span>","<svg/>Télécharger pour Windows","Windows 10 et 11 (64 bits) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Versions précédentes</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Code source</a>","<b>Falcon pour Android</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">Dernière version sur GitHub</span>","<svg/><span data-apk-label=\"\">Télécharger pour Android</span>","Android 7 ou plus récent · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Versions précédentes</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Code source</a>","<b>Falcon pour macOS</b><span data-mac-meta=\"\">Chargement de la dernière version …</span>","<svg/><span>Pour Mac avec puce Apple (M1–M4)</span>","<svg/><span>Pour Mac avec processeur Intel</span>","macOS 11 (Big Sur) ou plus récent · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Versions précédentes</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Code source</a>","<b>Falcon pour Linux</b><span data-linux-meta=\"\">Chargement de la dernière version …</span>","<svg/><span>.deb – Ubuntu, Debian, Mint</span>","<svg/><span>.rpm – Fedora, openSUSE</span>","64 bits (x86_64) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Versions précédentes</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Code source</a>","<b>Falcon pour appareils iOS</b><span data-ios-meta=\"\">Chargement de la dernière version …</span>","<svg/><span>Télécharger le .ipa</span>","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 ou plus récent · Installation avec <a href=\"https://github.com/nab138/iloader/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iloader</a> (Windows, macOS, Linux) · Sans installation : <a href=\"/app\">application web Falcon</a>","<b data-soon-title=\"\">Bientôt disponible</b><span>En préparation</span>","Vers l’application web Falcon","Tu peux choisir une autre version en haut à tout moment.","Prêt en trois étapes","Télécharger l’installateur","Clique en haut sur « Télécharger pour Windows ». Le fichier s’appelle <code>Falcon-Setup-<span data-version=\"\">…</span>.exe</code>.","Lancer l’installateur","Si Windows affiche « Windows a protégé votre ordinateur », clique sur <b>Informations complémentaires → Exécuter quand même</b>. Falcon n’est pas encore signé numériquement.","C’est parti","Falcon démarre aussitôt. Tu peux importer tes favoris et mots de passe depuis Chrome, Edge, Opera ou Firefox.","Falcon sur ton téléphone Android","Télécharger l’APK","Ouvre cette page sur ton téléphone et appuie en haut sur « Télécharger pour Android ». Le fichier s’appelle <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-apk-version=\"\">…</span>.apk</code>.","Autoriser l’installation","Android demande si ton navigateur peut installer des applications. Appuie sur <b>Paramètres → Autoriser cette source</b>, puis sur <b>Installer</b>. Falcon n’est pas encore sur le Play Store.","Se connecter","Connecte-toi avec ton compte Falcon – ou crée-en un directement dans l’app. Tes favoris, mots de passe, historique et FalCoins sont alors les mêmes sur ton téléphone et ton PC.","Falcon sur ton Mac","Télécharger le DMG","Choisis ton Mac en haut : <b>puce Apple</b> (M1, M2, M3, M4) ou <b>Intel</b>. Tu trouves lequel tu as sous  → <b>À propos de ce Mac</b>.","Glisser dans « Applications »","Ouvre le fichier téléchargé et fais glisser Falcon dans le dossier <b>Applications</b>.","Autoriser au premier lancement","Falcon n’est pas encore signé par Apple. Fais un clic droit sur Falcon dans le dossier Applications → <b>Ouvrir</b> → <b>Ouvrir</b>. Si macOS indique que l’app est « endommagée », saisis <code>xattr -cr /Applications/Falcon.app</code> dans le Terminal et relance Falcon.","Falcon sous Linux","Choisir le paquet","<b>.deb</b> pour Ubuntu, Debian, Linux Mint, Pop!_OS · <b>.rpm</b> pour Fedora, openSUSE, RHEL.","Installer","Un double-clic sur le fichier ouvre le gestionnaire de logiciels. Dans le terminal : <code>sudo apt install ./Falcon-*.deb</code> ou <code>sudo dnf install ./Falcon-*.rpm</code>.","Tu trouveras ensuite Falcon dans le menu des applications. Falcon se met à jour tout seul en arrière-plan, comme sous Windows.","Falcon sur les appareils iOS","Falcon n’est pas sur l’App Store. Tu installes le .ipa depuis ton ordinateur avec le programme gratuit <b>iloader</b> – sous Windows, macOS ou Linux, avec ton identifiant Apple habituel.","Télécharger iloader","Télécharge iloader gratuitement sur <b>github.com/nab138/iloader</b> sous « Releases » (ou sur <b>iloader.app</b> – seules ces deux sources sont officielles). Windows : <code>iloader-windows-x64.msi</code>, macOS : <code>iloader-darwin-universal.dmg</code>, Linux : <code>.deb</code>, <code>.rpm</code> ou <code>.AppImage</code>. Le bouton « Sponsor » sur GitHub n’est qu’un don facultatif.","Pour que l’ordinateur reconnaisse l’appareil","<b>Windows :</b> installe aussi <b>iTunes</b> d’Apple. <b>macOS :</b> rien à faire. <b>Linux :</b> installe <code>usbmuxd</code> s’il manque (Debian/Ubuntu : <code>sudo apt install usbmuxd</code>).","Télécharger le .ipa sur l’ordinateur","Télécharge le fichier <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-ios-version=\"\">…</span>.ipa</code> en haut sur ton ordinateur.","Brancher l’appareil","Branche ton iPhone ou iPad avec un <b>câble de données</b>, déverrouille-le et appuie sur « Se fier ». Si la question « Se fier » n’apparaît pas et que l’appareil ne fait que charger, essaie un autre câble ou un autre port USB.","Se connecter à iloader","Ouvre iloader et connecte-toi avec ton identifiant Apple (un compte gratuit suffit). Si la connexion échoue, choisis « Reset Anisette State » dans les réglages d’iloader et redémarre iloader.","Installer Falcon","Dans iloader, choisis ton appareil, puis <b>« Import IPA »</b> et le .ipa de Falcon. iloader signe Falcon avec ton identifiant Apple et l’installe sur l’appareil.","Autoriser sur l’appareil","Active le mode développeur sous <b>Réglages → Confidentialité et sécurité → Mode développeur</b> (l’option n’apparaît qu’après l’installation, puis redémarre) et fais confiance à ton identifiant Apple sous <b>Réglages → Général → VPN et gestion de l’appareil</b>. Falcon démarre ensuite.","Réinstaller tous les 7 jours","Avec un identifiant Apple gratuit, la signature expire au bout de 7 jours. Rebranche alors l’appareil et réinstalle Falcon avec iloader – tes données sont conservées. Les nouvelles versions de Falcon s’installent de la même façon.","Quoi de neuf ?","Nouveautés","Tu trouveras toutes les modifications dans les <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">notes de version sur GitHub</a>.","Configuration requise","Windows","Windows 10 ou 11, 64 bits","macOS 11 (Big Sur) ou plus récent, puce Apple ou Intel","64 bits, p. ex. Ubuntu 20.04+, Debian 11+, Fedora 36+ (.deb ou .rpm)","Mémoire vive","4 Go (8 Go recommandés)","Espace disque","env. 400 Mo","Android 7.0 ou plus récent","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 ou plus récent, installation avec iloader sur un ordinateur (Windows, macOS ou Linux)","Logo de Falcon","Choisir la plateforme","Plateforme","Télécharge Falcon gratuitement pour Windows, macOS, Linux, Android et iOS. Mises à jour automatiques, sans pub, open source.","FalCoins – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Accueil</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Fonctionnalités</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Captures</a><a href=\"/falcoins\" aria-current=\"page\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Télécharger</a>","FalCoins","Naviguer rapporte <span class=\"grad\">doublement.</span>","Avec un compte Falcon gratuit, tu collectes des FalCoins – en naviguant, avec la récompense quotidienne et avec les missions.","Comment gagner des <span class=\"grad\">FalCoins</span>","Visiter des sites","Pour chaque page que tu visites tant que tu es connecté.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>+1 par visite","Récompense quotidienne","Récupère tes pièces chaque jour – le 7e jour d’affilée, tu reçois un bonus.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>+10 · +50 de bonus","Missions","Trois nouvelles tâches chaque jour, p. ex. « Visite 20 pages » ou « Utilise le Game Mode 30 minutes ».","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>jusqu’à +45 par jour","Tout en un coup d’œil","L’historique des FalCoins montre chaque gain et chaque achat avec la date.","Transparent","Boutique FalCoins","Tout est désormais <span class=\"grad\">gratuit</span>","Toutes les fonctions bêta sont gratuites pour tous – même sans compte et sans FalCoins.","Accès bêta <span class=\"tag\" style=\"margin-left:6px\">Gratuit pour tous</span>","Tu n’as plus besoin d’acheter l’accès bêta : toutes ses fonctions font désormais partie de Falcon.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b> – met en pause et en veille les onglets en arrière-plan pour que ton jeu ait du processeur et de la mémoire</span>","<svg/><span><b>Mode RGB</b> – la couleur d’accent passe par toutes les couleurs, onglets et boutons brillent</span>","<svg/><span><b>Liste de souhaits promos</b> – Falcon te prévient quand un jeu est gratuit ou en promo</span>","<svg/><span><b>Traduire la page</b> – traduis les sites dans ta langue directement dans Falcon</span>","<svg/><span>Utilisable sans compte et sans FalCoins</span>","<svg/><span>Débloque la mission « 30 minutes de Game Mode »</span>","<svg/><span>Sans date d’expiration</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Gratuit pour tous","Game Mode","Le Game Mode est gratuit pour tous – active-le simplement dans la barre d’outils.","<svg/><span>Met en pause les onglets en arrière-plan après 30 secondes</span>","<svg/><span>Les met en veille plus tard, coupe les animations</span>","<svg/><span>Les onglets qui jouent du son restent actifs</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Gratuit pour tous","<b>Boutique FalCoins</b><span>Clique sur tes FalCoins dans le menu du compte.</span>","<b>Récompenses &amp; missions</b><span>Nouvelles chaque jour.</span>","Prêt pour le <span class=\"grad\">décollage ?</span>","Falcon est gratuit, s’installe en une minute et se met ensuite à jour tout seul en arrière-plan.","<svg/>Télécharger gratuitement","Agrandir la boutique FalCoins","La boutique FalCoins","Agrandir les récompenses","Récompense quotidienne et missions","Fermer","Image précédente","Image suivante","Collecte des FalCoins en naviguant, avec la récompense quotidienne et avec les missions. Toutes les fonctions bêta de Falcon sont gratuites pour tous.","FAQ – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Accueil</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Fonctionnalités</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Captures</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\" aria-current=\"page\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Télécharger</a>","FAQ","Questions <span class=\"grad\">fréquentes</span>","Ta question n’y est pas ? <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">Pose-la sur GitHub</a> ou utilise « Signaler un problème » dans Falcon.","Général","Falcon est-il gratuit ?<svg/>","Oui. Falcon est entièrement gratuit et open source (licence MIT). Il n’y a ni pub ni abonnement.","Sur quelle technologie repose Falcon ?<svg/>","Falcon repose sur Chromium – la même base que Chrome, Edge et Opera. Les sites fonctionnent donc exactement comme dans ces navigateurs.","Falcon existe-t-il pour Mac, Linux ou les téléphones ?<svg/>","Oui. Falcon existe pour Windows 10 et 11, pour macOS (puce Apple et Intel) et pour Linux (.deb et .rpm) – tout est sur la <a href=\"/download\">page de téléchargement</a>. Pour les téléphones Android, il y a l’application Falcon Mobile. Pour les appareils iOS, Falcon Mobile est fourni en .ipa, que tu installes depuis ton ordinateur avec le programme gratuit iloader (pas sur l’App Store).","Pourquoi Windows affiche-t-il un avertissement à l’installation ?<svg/>","Falcon n’est pas encore signé numériquement, c’est pourquoi Windows SmartScreen affiche un avertissement. Clique sur <b>Informations complémentaires → Exécuter quand même</b>. Tout le monde peut consulter le code source sur GitHub.","Comment obtenir les mises à jour ?<svg/>","Automatiquement. Falcon cherche de nouvelles versions au démarrage, les télécharge et les installe en arrière-plan – ensuite Falcon redémarre simplement. Tes onglets reviennent si « Au démarrage » est réglé sur la dernière session (par défaut). À partir de deux versions de retard, la mise à jour est obligatoire : d’ici là, ton compte Falcon et certaines fonctions sont bloqués ; ensuite, tu es reconnecté automatiquement.","Puis-je définir Falcon comme navigateur par défaut ?<svg/>","Oui, sous <b>Réglages → Général → Définir par défaut</b>. Falcon apparaît aussi dans les paramètres Windows sous <b>Applications → Applications par défaut</b>.","Gaming","Que fait exactement le Game Mode ?<svg/>","Il met en pause les onglets en arrière-plan après 30 secondes, les met en veille plus tard et coupe les animations. Ton jeu dispose ainsi de plus de processeur et de mémoire. Les onglets qui jouent du son restent actifs.","Comment obtenir le Game Mode ?<svg/>","Active-le simplement : le Game Mode est gratuit pour tous, même sans compte. Clique sur l’icône de manette dans la barre d’outils ou appuie sur Ctrl+Maj+G.","J’ai acheté quelque chose par erreur dans la boutique – que faire ?<svg/>","Ouvre la boutique FalCoins et appuie sur <b>Demander un remboursement</b>. Choisis l’achat, indique ton adresse e-mail et brièvement la raison. Tu recevras la réponse au prochain démarrage de Falcon. Si le remboursement est accepté, tu récupères tes FalCoins. <b>Important :</b> pour l’accès bêta, tu ne peux demander un remboursement que dans les <b>24 heures</b> suivant l’achat – pas après.","À quoi sert le limiteur réseau ?<svg/>","Il limite la bande passante des sites et des téléchargements pour que ton jeu dispose d’assez de connexion pour un ping stable – au choix toujours ou seulement en Game Mode.","Netflix et Disney+ fonctionnent-ils ?<svg/>","Pas encore. Ces services nécessitent une protection contre la copie (Widevine) que Falcon n’intègre pas pour le moment.","Compte, synchro &amp; FalCoins","Ai-je besoin d’un compte ?<svg/>","Non. Falcon fonctionne aussi sans compte. Tu n’as besoin d’un compte Falcon gratuit que pour la synchronisation entre PC, l’application mobile et les FalCoins.","Mes données synchronisées sont-elles sûres ?<svg/>","Les favoris, mots de passe, l’historique, les réglages et les onglets sont chiffrés sur ton PC en AES-256 avant d’être envoyés. La clé est protégée par ton mot de passe – le serveur ne voit que des données illisibles.","J’ai oublié mon mot de passe – que faire ?<svg/>","Via « Mot de passe oublié ? », tu reçois un lien par e-mail. Ensuite, tu déverrouilles une fois tes données synchronisées avec ton ancien mot de passe – ou tu repars des données de ton PC.","Que sont les FalCoins ?<svg/>","Des pièces que tu collectes en naviguant : 1 par site visité, 10 par jour en récompense (avec un bonus le 7e jour d’affilée) et jusqu’à 45 par jour pour les missions. Tu n’en as plus besoin pour les fonctions de Falcon – elles sont toutes gratuites.","Extensions &amp; confidentialité","Les extensions Chrome fonctionnent-elles ?<svg/>","Beaucoup, oui. Sur chaque page d’extension du Chrome Web Store apparaît le bouton <b>« Ajouter à Falcon »</b>. Comme Falcon ne prend en charge qu’une partie des interfaces d’extension, certaines ne fonctionnent que partiellement.","Falcon collecte-t-il des données sur moi ?<svg/>","Non. Falcon ne contient aucun traceur d’analyse ou publicitaire. Les détails sont dans la <a href=\"/datenschutz\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">politique de confidentialité</a>.","Comment signaler un problème ?<svg/>","Dans Falcon via <b>« Signaler un problème … »</b> dans le menu principal, ou sur <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">GitHub</a>.","Réponses aux questions fréquentes sur Falcon : prix, mises à jour, Game Mode, synchronisation, FalCoins, extensions et confidentialité.","Fonctionnalités – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Accueil</a><a href=\"/funktionen\" aria-current=\"page\">Fonctionnalités</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Captures</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Télécharger</a>","Fonctionnalités","Conçu pour <span class=\"grad\">ton setup.</span>","Du Game Mode au chiffrement de bout en bout : voici tout ce que contient Falcon.","🎮 Gaming","Toute la puissance <span class=\"grad\">pour ton jeu.</span>","Falcon sait que le navigateur tourne en arrière-plan pendant que tu joues – et se comporte en conséquence.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b> : met en pause et en veille les onglets en arrière-plan, coupe les animations</span>","<svg/><span><b>Limiteur réseau</b> : de 2 à 100 Mbit/s, toujours ou seulement en Game Mode</span>","<svg/><span><b>Limite de RAM</b> : les onglets inutilisés se mettent en veille dès que la limite est atteinte</span>","<svg/><span><b>Fenêtre en overlay</b> : ton stream ou ton guide reste toujours au premier plan</span>","<svg/><span><b>Volume par onglet</b> et image dans l’image pour les vidéos</span>","🧭 Navigation","Deux onglets. <span class=\"grad\">Une fenêtre.</span>","La vue partagée affiche deux pages côte à côte – la séparation se déplace librement.","<svg/><span><b>Vue partagée</b> avec séparation mobile</span>","<svg/><span><b>Palette de commandes</b> (Ctrl + K) pour les onglets, favoris et commandes</span>","<svg/><span><b>Mode lecture</b> (F9) pour des articles sans distraction</span>","<svg/><span><b>Outil de capture</b> : zone, partie visible ou page entière</span>","<svg/><span><b>Page des téléchargements</b> avec recherche, vitesse et reprise</span>","🕹️ Page d’accueil","Jeux gratuits, <span class=\"grad\">directement à l’écran.</span>","La page d’accueil te montre quels jeux sont gratuits en ce moment et quelles promos valent le coup – sur Steam, Epic Games et GOG.","<svg/><span><b>Jeux gratuits</b> du moment avec le temps restant</span>","<svg/><span><b>Promos</b> avec réduction et prix</span>","<svg/><span>Raccourcis personnels, horloge et image de fond</span>","Et bien plus encore","Les petits détails <span class=\"grad\">qui font la différence.</span>","Bloqueur de pubs","EasyList, EasyPrivacy et plus – plus de 150 000 règles, mises à jour chaque semaine. Le bouclier Falcon montre ce qui a été bloqué. Aussi dans l’application mobile.","Gestionnaire de mots de passe","Enregistre les identifiants de façon chiffrée, propose des mots de passe sûrs et alerte en cas de fuite de données ou de mots de passe réutilisés.","Clés d’accès","Connecte-toi avec Windows Hello, ton iPhone, ton téléphone Android ou une clé de sécurité.","Compte &amp; synchro","Favoris, mots de passe, historique, réglages et onglets ouverts – chiffrés de bout en bout.","Application mobile","Falcon pour Android et iOS : onglets, favoris, mots de passe, bloqueur de pubs, FalCoins et boutique – comme sur ton PC.","Aperçu des onglets","Passe la souris sur un onglet et vois aussitôt une petite image de la page – sans changer d’onglet.","Mode RGB","La couleur d’accent passe par toutes les couleurs, onglets et boutons brillent comme ton clavier gaming.","Liste de souhaits promos","Enregistre des jeux – Falcon te prévient dès qu’un jeu est gratuit ou réduit d’au moins 20 %.","Extensions Chrome","À installer directement depuis le Chrome Web Store – avec le bouton « Ajouter à Falcon ».","Fenêtres de navigation privée","Une session séparée en mémoire : une fois fermée, tout disparaît.","Traduire la page","Traduis les sites dans ta langue directement dans Falcon – sans passer par un autre site. Par clic droit, Ctrl + K ou dans le menu de l’application mobile.","5 langues","Deutsch, English, Français, Español et Türkçe – Falcon suit la langue de ton système.","Navigateur par défaut","Les liens et fichiers HTML d’autres programmes s’ouvrent dans Falcon si tu le souhaites.","Barre latérale","Discord, Twitch, Spotify ou n’importe quelle application web toujours à portée de main sur le côté.","Mises à jour invisibles","Les nouvelles versions s’installent en arrière-plan – Falcon redémarre simplement.","Indicateur de performances avec Game Mode","Deux sites côte à côte en vue partagée","Jeux gratuits et promos sur la page d’accueil de Falcon","Toutes les fonctionnalités de Falcon : Game Mode, limiteur réseau, vue partagée, bloqueur de pubs, gestionnaire de mots de passe, clés d’accès, synchronisation chiffrée et plus.","Falcon – Le navigateur des gamers","<a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Accueil</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Fonctionnalités</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Captures</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Télécharger</a>","Le navigateur conçu <span class=\"grad\">pour les gamers</span>.","Falcon rend à tes jeux processeur, mémoire et bande passante – avec le Game Mode, un limiteur réseau, un bloqueur de pubs intégré et une synchronisation chiffrée de bout en bout.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/download\" data-cta=\"\"><svg/><span data-cta-label=\"\">Télécharger gratuitement</span></a> <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/funktionen\">Toutes les fonctionnalités<svg/></a>","<span><svg/>Gratuit &amp; open source</span> <span><svg/>Windows, macOS &amp; Linux</span> <span><svg/>Mises à jour automatiques</span>","<b>150 000+</b><span>règles de filtrage contre les pubs</span>","<b>AES-256</b><span>chiffrement de bout en bout</span>","<b>5</b><span>langues</span>","<b>0 €</b><span>gratuit pour toujours</span>","Pourquoi Falcon ?","Tout ce qu’il te faut. <span class=\"grad\">Rien qui ralentit.</span>","Falcon repose sur Chromium – tous les sites fonctionnent comme d’habitude. S’y ajoutent des fonctions que les autres navigateurs n’ont pas.","Met en pause les onglets en arrière-plan et les met en veille pour que ton jeu ait toute la puissance.","Limiteur réseau","Limite téléchargements et sites – pour un ping stable, même quand quelque chose se charge à côté.","Plus de 150 000 règles de filtrage bloquent pubs, traceurs et, si tu veux, bannières de cookies.","Vue partagée","Guide et carte, stream et chat : deux onglets côte à côte dans une seule fenêtre.","Synchronisation chiffrée","Favoris, mots de passe, historique et onglets sur tous tes PC – lisibles uniquement par toi.","Collecte des pièces en naviguant, avec la récompense quotidienne et avec les missions.","Plus de FPS. <span class=\"grad\">Moins de superflu.</span>","Un clic et Falcon fait le ménage en arrière-plan : les onglets dont tu n’as pas besoin sont mis en pause puis en veille. L’indicateur de performances te montre en direct combien de processeur et de mémoire Falcon utilise.","<svg/><span><b>Met en pause les onglets en arrière-plan</b> après 30 secondes – sans les fermer</span>","<svg/><span><b>Les onglets qui jouent du son restent actifs</b> – ta musique continue</span>","<svg/><span><b>Limite de RAM</b> : Falcon reste sous la limite que tu fixes</span>","<svg/><span><b>Limiteur réseau</b> inclus aussi</span>","Productif","Tout au clavier. <span class=\"grad\">Ctrl + K.</span>","La palette de commandes trouve les onglets ouverts, les favoris, ton historique et chaque commande de Falcon – à toute vitesse et sans souris.","<svg/><span>Changer d’onglet, activer le Game Mode, ouvrir les réglages</span>","<svg/><span>Ouvrir directement les onglets de tes autres PC</span>","<svg/><span>Captures d’écran avec <b>Ctrl + Maj + S</b></span>","Sûr","Tes données t’appartiennent <span class=\"grad\">à toi.</span>","Avec un compte Falcon gratuit, tes données te suivent sur chaque PC. Tout est chiffré sur ton appareil avant l’envoi – même le serveur ne peut pas le lire.","<svg/><span><b>Gestionnaire de mots de passe</b> avec générateur et vérification des fuites</span>","<svg/><span><b>Clés d’accès</b> avec iPhone, Android ou clé de sécurité</span>","<svg/><span><b>Application mobile</b> pour Android et iOS avec onglets, mots de passe, FalCoins et boutique</span>","La page d’accueil de Falcon avec raccourcis et jeux gratuits du moment","L’indicateur de performances de Falcon avec le Game Mode activé","La palette de commandes de Falcon","Le menu du compte de Falcon avec FalCoins et état de la synchronisation","Falcon est un navigateur rapide et gratuit pour les gamers : Game Mode, limiteur réseau, bloqueur de pubs, vue partagée et synchronisation chiffrée de bout en bout.","Captures – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Accueil</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Fonctionnalités</a><a href=\"/screenshots\" aria-current=\"page\">Captures</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Télécharger</a>","Captures d’écran","Voici à quoi ressemble <span class=\"grad\">Falcon</span>.","Sombre, épuré et rapide. Clique sur une image pour l’agrandir.","<b>Page d’accueil</b><span>Raccourcis, recherche et jeux gratuits du moment.</span>","<b>Performances &amp; Game Mode</b><span>Processeur et mémoire en direct – Game Mode en un clic.</span>","<b>Vue partagée</b><span>Deux pages côte à côte, séparation librement mobile.</span>","<b>Palette de commandes</b><span>Onglets, favoris et commandes avec Ctrl + K.</span>","<b>Jeux gratuits &amp; promos</b><span>Jeux gratuits et réductions sur Steam, Epic et GOG.</span>","<b>Compte &amp; FalCoins</b><span>État de la synchro, FalCoins et missions dans le menu du compte.</span>","<b>Boutique FalCoins</b><span>Ton solde et tous les articles en un coup d’œil.</span>","<b>Récompenses &amp; missions</b><span>Récompense quotidienne avec bonus de série et missions.</span>","Agrandir la page d’accueil","Page d’accueil","Agrandir Performances & Game Mode","Performances & Game Mode","Agrandir la vue partagée","Agrandir la palette de commandes","Palette de commandes","Agrandir Jeux gratuits & promos","Jeux gratuits & promos","Agrandir Compte & FalCoins","Compte & FalCoins","Agrandir Récompenses & missions","Récompenses & missions","Captures d’écran de Falcon : page d’accueil, Game Mode, vue partagée, palette de commandes, jeux gratuits, boutique FalCoins et plus.","Version {v}","Dernière version","Dernière version sur GitHub","Aucune version publiée pour l’instant","Bientôt disponible","Disponible avec la prochaine version","{a} et {b}","<b>La nouvelle version est en préparation pour le téléchargement.</b> Falcon {v} pour {p} sera disponible dans les prochaines minutes.","Vers le téléchargement","La version {v} est en préparation pour le téléchargement. En attendant, tu reçois la version {o} – elle se mettra à jour automatiquement ensuite.","La version {v} est en préparation pour le téléchargement. En attendant, tu reçois la version précédente – elle se mettra à jour automatiquement ensuite.","La version {v} pour {p} est en préparation pour le téléchargement. Cela prend encore quelques minutes.","La nouvelle version Android est en préparation pour le téléchargement. En attendant, tu reçois la version {o}.","La nouvelle version Android est en préparation pour le téléchargement. En attendant, tu reçois la précédente.","Téléphone Android","Tablette Android","PC Linux","Puce Apple","Télécharger gratuitement","Télécharger l’app Android","Télécharger pour appareils iOS","Télécharger pour macOS","Télécharger pour Linux","Détecté : {d}","Choisis ta plateforme","Nouveau","Extrait des <a>notes de version</a> (en anglais).","Tu trouveras toutes les modifications dans les <a>notes de version sur GitHub</a>.","Langue","<b>Falcon {v} pour {p} est en préparation pour le téléchargement.</b> Cela prend encore quelques minutes – {r} sont déjà disponibles.","<b>Falcon {v} pour {p} est en préparation pour le téléchargement.</b> Cela prend encore quelques minutes – {r} est déjà disponible.","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">Chargement de la dernière version …</span>","Détection de ton appareil …","<b>Falcon pour Windows</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">Chargement de la dernière version …</span>","<b>Falcon pour Android</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">Chargement de la dernière version …</span>","Chargement des nouveautés …","<svg/><span><b>Couleur d’accent</b> – Falcon dans ta couleur, même personnalisée</span>"],"es":["Página no encontrada – Falcon","Saltar al contenido","<img src=\"/assets/logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Inicio</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funciones</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Capturas</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Descargar</a>","<svg/>Descargar","Error 404","Esta página ha <span class=\"grad\">salido volando.</span>","Esta dirección no existe (o ya no existe). Quizá te ayude uno de estos enlaces.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/\">Ir al inicio</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Descargar</a>","El navegador rápido y centrado para gamers. Gratis y de código abierto.","Falcon","<a href=\"/funktionen\">Funciones</a>","<a href=\"/screenshots\">Capturas</a>","<a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a>","<a href=\"/download\">Descargar</a>","Ayuda","<a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Informar de un problema</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Novedades</a>","Proyecto","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>","<a href=\"/datenschutz\">Privacidad</a>","<span>© <span data-year=\"\">2026</span> Falcon · Licencia MIT</span> <span>Versión actual <span data-version=\"\">…</span></span>","Falcon – Inicio","Menú principal","Abrir menú","Esta página no existe.","Privacidad – Falcon","Aviso legal","Privacidad","Cómo tratan tus datos este sitio web y el navegador Falcon.","En resumen: este sitio no usa cookies, ni rastreadores de análisis o publicidad, y no carga fuentes ni scripts de terceros. El navegador Falcon tampoco contiene rastreadores; los datos sincronizados se cifran de extremo a extremo.","1. Responsable","El responsable de este sitio web y del navegador Falcon es Calvin, el desarrollador de Falcon.","Puedes hacer preguntas sobre privacidad a través de los <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">issues en GitHub</a> o con «Informar de un problema» en Falcon.","2. Este sitio web","Alojamiento en Vercel","Este sitio web está alojado por Vercel Inc., 440 N Barranca Ave #4133, Covina, CA 91723, EE. UU. Al visitarlo, Vercel procesa datos técnicamente necesarios como la dirección IP, la fecha y la hora, la página solicitada, el navegador y el sistema operativo para servir la página y protegerla de ataques. La base jurídica es nuestro interés legítimo en un funcionamiento seguro y estable (art. 6, apdo. 1, letra f del RGPD). Vercel está certificado según el EU-US Data Privacy Framework; más información en la <a href=\"https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">política de privacidad de Vercel</a>.","Versión actual desde GitHub","Para que el botón de descarga, el número de versión y las novedades estén siempre al día, tu navegador consulta información pública de GitHub al visitar este sitio (<code>api.github.com</code>, <code>raw.githubusercontent.com</code>). Para ello se transmite tu dirección IP a GitHub Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, EE. UU. La descarga en sí también se realiza a través de GitHub. La base jurídica es el art. 6, apdo. 1, letra f del RGPD. Consulta también la <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/de/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">política de privacidad de GitHub</a>.","Cookies y almacenamiento local","Este sitio no usa cookies. El número de versión consultado y el idioma elegido se guardan en el almacenamiento local de tu navegador para que la página cargue más rápido; puedes borrarlos en cualquier momento en los ajustes del navegador.","3. El navegador Falcon","Falcon funciona sin cuenta. En ese caso, los marcadores, el historial y los ajustes se quedan en tu PC. Las contraseñas guardadas se protegen con el cifrado de tu sistema operativo.","Cuenta de Falcon, sincronización y FalCoins","Si creas una cuenta de Falcon, el inicio de sesión y el almacenamiento de datos se gestionan mediante Google Firebase (Google Ireland Ltd., Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublín 4, Irlanda). Se guardan tu dirección de correo, tu nombre visible, tu saldo de FalCoins, las funciones desbloqueadas, el progreso de las misiones y el historial de FalCoins.","Los marcadores, contraseñas, el historial, los ajustes y las pestañas abiertas se <b>cifran en tu dispositivo antes de subirse</b> (AES-256-GCM). La clave está protegida con tu contraseña; ni Firebase ni el desarrollador pueden leer estos datos. La base jurídica es la prestación de las funciones de la cuenta (art. 6, apdo. 1, letra b del RGPD). Puedes eliminar tu cuenta con todos sus datos en cualquier momento en Falcon en <b>Ajustes → Cuenta &amp; sincronización → Eliminar cuenta</b>.","Informes de problemas","Si informas de un problema en Falcon, se guardan la descripción, el tipo de informe, la versión de Falcon y la fecha. La descripción puede verla de forma anónima cualquier usuario de Falcon en <code>falcon://reports</code> – no incluyas información personal. La dirección de correo, la dirección de la página, la captura y el sistema operativo son opcionales y solo los ve el desarrollador.","Otros servicios","<b>Actualizaciones:</b> Falcon consulta a GitHub si hay nuevas versiones.","<b>Juegos gratis y ofertas</b> de la página de inicio provienen de GamerPower y CheapShark (desactivable).","<b>Los iconos de las webs</b> (favicons) se cargan a través de un servicio de Google.","<b>Bloqueador de anuncios:</b> las listas de filtros se descargan una vez por semana de fuentes públicas.","<b>Comprobación de contraseñas:</b> solo se envían los 5 primeros caracteres de un hash a «Have I Been Pwned», nunca la contraseña.","<b>Traducir página</b> envía el texto de la página a Google Traductor.","<b>Las extensiones</b> se cargan desde la Chrome Web Store de Google.","4. Tus derechos","Tienes derecho de acceso (art. 15 RGPD), rectificación (art. 16), supresión (art. 17), limitación del tratamiento (art. 18), portabilidad de los datos (art. 20) y oposición a tratamientos basados en intereses legítimos (art. 21). También puedes presentar una reclamación ante una autoridad de protección de datos (art. 77 RGPD).","5. Cambios","Esta política de privacidad se actualiza cuando cambian Falcon o este sitio web. Última actualización: noviembre de 2026.","Política de privacidad de falconbrowser.de y del navegador Falcon.","Descargar – Falcon","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">Última versión</span>","Descargar <span class=\"grad\">Falcon</span>","Gratis, sin anuncios y de código abierto. Tras instalarlo, Falcon se mantiene actualizado solo.","Detectado: PC con Windows · Windows 11","<span class=\"dl-select-ic\" data-platform-icon=\"\"><svg/></span> <span class=\"dl-select-label\">Versión para</span> <b data-platform-current=\"\">PC con Windows</b> <svg/>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>PC con Windows</b><small>Windows 10 y 11</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Android</b><small>Móvil y tablet, APK</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Dispositivos iOS</b><small>.ipa</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>macOS</b><small>Chip de Apple e Intel</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Linux</b><small>.deb y .rpm</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","PC con Windows","Android","Dispositivos iOS","macOS","Linux","<b>Falcon para Windows</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">Última versión en GitHub</span>","<svg/>Descargar para Windows","Windows 10 y 11 (64 bits) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Versiones anteriores</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Código fuente</a>","<b>Falcon para Android</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">Última versión en GitHub</span>","<svg/><span data-apk-label=\"\">Descargar para Android</span>","Android 7 o posterior · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Versiones anteriores</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Código fuente</a>","<b>Falcon para macOS</b><span data-mac-meta=\"\">Cargando la última versión …</span>","<svg/><span>Para Mac con chip de Apple (M1–M4)</span>","<svg/><span>Para Mac con procesador Intel</span>","macOS 11 (Big Sur) o posterior · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Versiones anteriores</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Código fuente</a>","<b>Falcon para Linux</b><span data-linux-meta=\"\">Cargando la última versión …</span>","<svg/><span>.deb – Ubuntu, Debian, Mint</span>","<svg/><span>.rpm – Fedora, openSUSE</span>","64 bits (x86_64) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Versiones anteriores</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Código fuente</a>","<b>Falcon para dispositivos iOS</b><span data-ios-meta=\"\">Cargando la última versión …</span>","<svg/><span>Descargar .ipa</span>","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 o posterior · Instalación con <a href=\"https://github.com/nab138/iloader/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iloader</a> (Windows, macOS, Linux) · Sin instalar: <a href=\"/app\">app web de Falcon</a>","<b data-soon-title=\"\">Próximamente</b><span>En preparación</span>","Ir a la app web de Falcon","Puedes elegir otra versión arriba en cualquier momento.","Listo en tres pasos","Descargar el instalador","Haz clic arriba en «Descargar para Windows». El archivo se llama <code>Falcon-Setup-<span data-version=\"\">…</span>.exe</code>.","Ejecutar el instalador","Si Windows muestra «Windows protegió su PC», haz clic en <b>Más información → Ejecutar de todas formas</b>. Falcon aún no tiene firma digital.","¡A empezar!","Falcon se abre al instante. Puedes importar marcadores y contraseñas desde Chrome, Edge, Opera o Firefox.","Falcon en tu móvil Android","Descargar la APK","Abre esta página en el móvil y toca arriba «Descargar para Android». El archivo se llama <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-apk-version=\"\">…</span>.apk</code>.","Permitir la instalación","Android pregunta si tu navegador puede instalar apps. Toca <b>Ajustes → Permitir desde esta fuente</b> y después <b>Instalar</b>. Falcon aún no está en Play Store.","Iniciar sesión","Inicia sesión con tu cuenta de Falcon – o crea una directamente en la app. Tus marcadores, contraseñas, historial y FalCoins serán los mismos en el móvil y en el PC.","Falcon en tu Mac","Descargar el DMG","Elige tu Mac arriba: <b>chip de Apple</b> (M1, M2, M3, M4) o <b>Intel</b>. Puedes ver cuál tienes en  → <b>Acerca de este Mac</b>.","Arrastrar a «Aplicaciones»","Abre el archivo descargado y arrastra Falcon a la carpeta <b>Aplicaciones</b>.","Permitir en el primer inicio","Falcon aún no está firmado por Apple. Haz clic derecho en Falcon en la carpeta Aplicaciones → <b>Abrir</b> → <b>Abrir</b>. Si macOS dice que la app está «dañada», escribe <code>xattr -cr /Applications/Falcon.app</code> en Terminal y vuelve a abrir Falcon.","Falcon en Linux","Elegir paquete","<b>.deb</b> para Ubuntu, Debian, Linux Mint, Pop!_OS · <b>.rpm</b> para Fedora, openSUSE, RHEL.","Instalar","Al hacer doble clic en el archivo se abre el gestor de software. En la terminal: <code>sudo apt install ./Falcon-*.deb</code> o <code>sudo dnf install ./Falcon-*.rpm</code>.","Después encontrarás Falcon en el menú de aplicaciones. Falcon se actualiza solo en segundo plano, igual que en Windows.","Falcon en dispositivos iOS","Falcon no está en la App Store. Instalas la .ipa desde tu ordenador con el programa gratuito <b>iloader</b> – en Windows, macOS o Linux y con tu Apple ID normal.","Descargar iloader","Descarga iloader gratis desde <b>github.com/nab138/iloader</b> en «Releases» (o desde <b>iloader.app</b> – solo estas dos fuentes son oficiales). Windows: <code>iloader-windows-x64.msi</code>, macOS: <code>iloader-darwin-universal.dmg</code>, Linux: <code>.deb</code>, <code>.rpm</code> o <code>.AppImage</code>. El botón «Sponsor» de GitHub es solo una donación voluntaria.","Para que el ordenador reconozca el dispositivo","<b>Windows:</b> instala además <b>iTunes</b> de Apple. <b>macOS:</b> no hace falta nada. <b>Linux:</b> instala <code>usbmuxd</code> si falta (Debian/Ubuntu: <code>sudo apt install usbmuxd</code>).","Descargar la .ipa en el ordenador","Descarga arriba el archivo <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-ios-version=\"\">…</span>.ipa</code> en tu ordenador.","Conectar el dispositivo","Conecta el iPhone o iPad con un <b>cable de datos</b>, desbloquéalo y toca «Confiar». Si no aparece la pregunta «Confiar» y el dispositivo solo se carga, prueba otro cable u otro puerto USB.","Iniciar sesión en iloader","Abre iloader e inicia sesión con tu Apple ID (basta con uno gratuito). Si no funciona, elige «Reset Anisette State» en los ajustes de iloader y reinicia iloader.","Instalar Falcon","En iloader, elige tu dispositivo, luego <b>«Import IPA»</b> y la .ipa de Falcon. iloader firma Falcon con tu Apple ID y lo instala en el dispositivo.","Permitir en el dispositivo","Activa el modo de desarrollador en <b>Ajustes → Privacidad y seguridad → Modo de desarrollador</b> (la opción solo aparece tras la instalación; después reinicia) y confía en tu Apple ID en <b>Ajustes → General → VPN y gestión de dispositivos</b>. Después, Falcon se abrirá.","Reinstalar cada 7 días","Con un Apple ID gratuito, la firma caduca a los 7 días. Entonces vuelve a conectar el dispositivo y reinstala Falcon con iloader – tus datos se conservan. Las nuevas versiones de Falcon se instalan igual.","¿Qué hay de nuevo?","Novedades","Encontrarás todos los cambios en las <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">novedades en GitHub</a>.","Requisitos del sistema","Windows","Windows 10 u 11, 64 bits","macOS 11 (Big Sur) o posterior, chip de Apple o Intel","64 bits, p. ej. Ubuntu 20.04+, Debian 11+, Fedora 36+ (.deb o .rpm)","Memoria","4 GB (8 GB recomendados)","Espacio en disco","aprox. 400 MB","Android 7.0 o posterior","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 o posterior, instalación con iloader en un ordenador (Windows, macOS o Linux)","Logotipo de Falcon","Elegir plataforma","Plataforma","Descarga Falcon gratis para Windows, macOS, Linux, Android e iOS. Actualizaciones automáticas, sin anuncios, de código abierto.","FalCoins – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Inicio</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funciones</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Capturas</a><a href=\"/falcoins\" aria-current=\"page\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Descargar</a>","FalCoins","Navegar ahora te da <span class=\"grad\">el doble.</span>","Con una cuenta gratuita de Falcon reúnes FalCoins: navegando, con la recompensa diaria y con misiones.","Así ganas <span class=\"grad\">FalCoins</span>","Visitar webs","Por cada página que visitas mientras tienes la sesión iniciada.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>+1 por visita","Recompensa diaria","Recoge tus monedas cada día – el 7.º día seguido hay un bonus.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>+10 · +50 de bonus","Misiones","Tres tareas nuevas cada día, p. ej. «Visita 20 páginas» o «Usa el Game Mode 30 minutos».","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>hasta +45 al día","Todo a la vista","El historial de FalCoins muestra cada ingreso y cada compra con su fecha.","Transparente","Tienda de FalCoins","Ahora todo es <span class=\"grad\">gratis</span>","Todas las funciones beta son gratis para todos, incluso sin cuenta y sin FalCoins.","Acceso beta <span class=\"tag\" style=\"margin-left:6px\">Gratis para todos</span>","Ya no tienes que comprar el acceso beta: todas sus funciones forman parte de Falcon.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b> – pausa y duerme las pestañas en segundo plano para que tu juego tenga CPU y memoria</span>","<svg/><span><b>Modo RGB</b> – el color de acento recorre todos los colores, las pestañas y botones brillan</span>","<svg/><span><b>Lista de deseos de ofertas</b> – Falcon te avisa cuando un juego está gratis o rebajado</span>","<svg/><span><b>Traducir página</b> – traduce webs a tu idioma directamente en Falcon</span>","<svg/><span>Se puede usar sin cuenta y sin FalCoins</span>","<svg/><span>Desbloquea la misión «30 minutos de Game Mode»</span>","<svg/><span>Sin fecha de caducidad</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Gratis para todos","Game Mode","El Game Mode es gratis para todos: actívalo en la barra de herramientas.","<svg/><span>Pausa las pestañas en segundo plano a los 30 segundos</span>","<svg/><span>Las duerme más tarde y desactiva las animaciones</span>","<svg/><span>Las pestañas con sonido siguen activas</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Gratis para todos","<b>Tienda de FalCoins</b><span>Haz clic en tus FalCoins en el menú de la cuenta.</span>","<b>Recompensas y misiones</b><span>Nuevas cada día.</span>","¿Listo para <span class=\"grad\">despegar?</span>","Falcon es gratis, se instala en un minuto y luego se actualiza solo en segundo plano.","<svg/>Descargar gratis","Ampliar la tienda de FalCoins","La tienda de FalCoins","Ampliar recompensas","Recompensa diaria y misiones","Cerrar","Imagen anterior","Imagen siguiente","Reúne FalCoins navegando, con la recompensa diaria y con misiones. Todas las funciones beta de Falcon son gratis para todos.","FAQ – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Inicio</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funciones</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Capturas</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\" aria-current=\"page\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Descargar</a>","FAQ","Preguntas <span class=\"grad\">frecuentes</span>","¿No está tu pregunta? <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">Pregunta en GitHub</a> o usa «Informar de un problema» en Falcon.","General","¿Falcon es gratis?<svg/>","Sí. Falcon es totalmente gratis y de código abierto (licencia MIT). No tiene anuncios ni suscripción.","¿En qué tecnología se basa Falcon?<svg/>","Falcon se basa en Chromium – la misma base que Chrome, Edge y Opera. Por eso las webs funcionan exactamente igual que allí.","¿Hay Falcon para Mac, Linux o el móvil?<svg/>","Sí. Falcon está disponible para Windows 10 y 11, para macOS (chip de Apple e Intel) y para Linux (.deb y .rpm) – todo en la <a href=\"/download\">página de descarga</a>. Para móviles Android existe la app Falcon Mobile. Para dispositivos iOS, Falcon Mobile se ofrece como .ipa, que instalas desde tu ordenador con el programa gratuito iloader (no está en la App Store).","¿Por qué Windows muestra una advertencia al instalar?<svg/>","Falcon aún no tiene firma digital, por eso Windows SmartScreen muestra una advertencia. Haz clic en <b>Más información → Ejecutar de todas formas</b>. Cualquiera puede revisar el código fuente en GitHub.","¿Cómo recibo las actualizaciones?<svg/>","Automáticamente. Falcon busca nuevas versiones al iniciarse, las descarga y las instala en segundo plano – después Falcon simplemente se reinicia. Tus pestañas vuelven si en «Al iniciar» está elegida la última sesión (predeterminado). Con dos o más versiones de retraso, la actualización es obligatoria: hasta entonces tu cuenta de Falcon y algunas funciones están bloqueadas; después tu sesión se inicia sola.","¿Puedo poner Falcon como navegador predeterminado?<svg/>","Sí, en <b>Ajustes → General → Establecer como predeterminado</b>. Falcon también aparece en la configuración de Windows en <b>Aplicaciones → Aplicaciones predeterminadas</b>.","Gaming","¿Qué hace exactamente el Game Mode?<svg/>","Pausa las pestañas en segundo plano a los 30 segundos, las duerme más tarde y desactiva las animaciones. Así tu juego tiene más CPU y memoria. Las pestañas que reproducen sonido siguen activas.","¿Cómo consigo el Game Mode?<svg/>","Solo tienes que activarlo: el Game Mode es gratis para todos, incluso sin cuenta. Haz clic en el icono del mando en la barra de herramientas o pulsa Ctrl+Mayús+G.","He comprado algo por error en la tienda – ¿y ahora?<svg/>","Abre la tienda de FalCoins y toca <b>Solicitar reembolso</b>. Elige la compra, indica tu correo y brevemente el motivo. Recibirás la respuesta la próxima vez que abras Falcon. Si se aprueba el reembolso, recuperas tus FalCoins. <b>Importante:</b> para el acceso beta solo puedes solicitar un reembolso en las <b>24 horas</b> siguientes a la compra – después ya no.","¿Para qué sirve el limitador de red?<svg/>","Limita el ancho de banda de webs y descargas para que tu juego tenga suficiente conexión para un ping estable – siempre o solo en Game Mode, como prefieras.","¿Funcionan Netflix y Disney+?<svg/>","Todavía no. Estos servicios necesitan una protección anticopia (Widevine) que Falcon no incluye por ahora.","Cuenta, sincronización y FalCoins","¿Necesito una cuenta?<svg/>","No. Falcon también funciona sin cuenta. Solo necesitas una cuenta gratuita de Falcon para sincronizar entre PCs, la app móvil y los FalCoins.","¿Qué tan seguros están mis datos sincronizados?<svg/>","Los marcadores, contraseñas, el historial, los ajustes y las pestañas se cifran en tu PC con AES-256 antes de subirse. La clave está protegida con tu contraseña – el servidor solo ve datos ilegibles.","He olvidado mi contraseña – ¿y ahora?<svg/>","En «¿Has olvidado la contraseña?» recibirás un enlace por correo. Después desbloqueas una vez tus datos sincronizados con tu contraseña anterior – o empiezas de nuevo con los datos de tu PC.","¿Qué son los FalCoins?<svg/>","Monedas que reúnes al navegar: 1 por cada web visitada, 10 diarias como recompensa (con bono el 7.º día seguido) y hasta 45 diarias por misiones. Ya no las necesitas para las funciones de Falcon: todas son gratis.","Extensiones y privacidad","¿Funcionan las extensiones de Chrome?<svg/>","Muchas sí. En cada página de extensión de la Chrome Web Store aparece el botón <b>«Añadir a Falcon»</b>. Como Falcon solo admite parte de las interfaces de extensiones, algunas funcionan solo en parte.","¿Falcon recopila datos sobre mí?<svg/>","No. Falcon no contiene rastreadores de análisis ni de publicidad. Tienes los detalles en la <a href=\"/datenschutz\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">política de privacidad</a>.","¿Cómo informo de un problema?<svg/>","En Falcon, en el menú principal con <b>«Informar de un problema …»</b>, o en <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">GitHub</a>.","Respuestas a preguntas frecuentes sobre Falcon: precio, actualizaciones, Game Mode, sincronización, FalCoins, extensiones y privacidad.","Funciones – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Inicio</a><a href=\"/funktionen\" aria-current=\"page\">Funciones</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Capturas</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Descargar</a>","Funciones","Hecho para <span class=\"grad\">tu setup.</span>","Del Game Mode al cifrado de extremo a extremo: esto es todo lo que trae Falcon.","🎮 Gaming","Toda la potencia <span class=\"grad\">para tu juego.</span>","Falcon sabe que el navegador funciona en segundo plano mientras juegas – y se comporta en consecuencia.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b>: pausa y duerme las pestañas en segundo plano y desactiva las animaciones</span>","<svg/><span><b>Limitador de red</b>: de 2 a 100 Mbit/s, siempre o solo en Game Mode</span>","<svg/><span><b>Límite de RAM</b>: las pestañas sin usar se duermen al alcanzar el límite</span>","<svg/><span><b>Ventana superpuesta</b>: tu stream o guía siempre queda en primer plano</span>","<svg/><span><b>Volumen por pestaña</b> e imagen en imagen para vídeos</span>","🧭 Navegación","Dos pestañas. <span class=\"grad\">Una ventana.</span>","La vista dividida muestra dos páginas una al lado de la otra – la línea divisoria se mueve libremente.","<svg/><span><b>Vista dividida</b> con línea divisoria movible</span>","<svg/><span><b>Paleta de comandos</b> (Ctrl + K) para pestañas, marcadores y comandos</span>","<svg/><span><b>Vista de lectura</b> (F9) para artículos sin distracciones</span>","<svg/><span><b>Herramienta de capturas</b>: área, parte visible o página completa</span>","<svg/><span><b>Página de descargas</b> con búsqueda, velocidad y reanudación</span>","🕹️ Página de inicio","Juegos gratis, <span class=\"grad\">directamente en pantalla.</span>","La página de inicio te muestra qué juegos están gratis ahora mismo y qué ofertas merecen la pena – de Steam, Epic Games y GOG.","<svg/><span><b>Juegos gratis</b> actuales con el tiempo restante</span>","<svg/><span><b>Ofertas</b> con descuento y precio</span>","<svg/><span>Accesos directos propios, reloj e imagen de fondo</span>","Y mucho más","Pequeños detalles <span class=\"grad\">que marcan la diferencia.</span>","Bloqueador de anuncios","EasyList, EasyPrivacy y más – más de 150.000 reglas, actualizadas cada semana. El escudo de Falcon muestra lo que se ha bloqueado. También en la app móvil.","Gestor de contraseñas","Guarda los inicios de sesión cifrados, sugiere contraseñas seguras y avisa de filtraciones de datos y contraseñas repetidas.","Llaves de acceso","Inicia sesión con Windows Hello, tu iPhone, tu móvil Android o una llave de seguridad.","Cuenta y sincronización","Marcadores, contraseñas, historial, ajustes y pestañas abiertas – cifrados de extremo a extremo.","App móvil","Falcon para Android e iOS: pestañas, marcadores, contraseñas, bloqueador de anuncios, FalCoins y la tienda – igual que en el PC.","Vista previa de pestañas","Pasa el ratón sobre una pestaña y ve al instante una pequeña imagen de la página – sin cambiar de pestaña.","Modo RGB","El color de acento recorre todos los colores; las pestañas y botones brillan como tu teclado gaming.","Lista de deseos de ofertas","Guarda juegos – Falcon te avisa en cuanto uno esté gratis o rebajado al menos un 20 %.","Extensiones de Chrome","Instálalas directamente desde la Chrome Web Store – con el botón «Añadir a Falcon».","Ventanas de incógnito","Una sesión separada en memoria: al cerrarla, todo desaparece.","Traducir página","Traduce webs a tu idioma directamente en Falcon – sin pasar por otra página. Con clic derecho, Ctrl + K o en el menú de la app móvil.","5 idiomas","Deutsch, English, Français, Español y Türkçe – Falcon sigue el idioma de tu sistema.","Navegador predeterminado","Los enlaces y archivos HTML de otros programas se abren en Falcon si quieres.","Barra lateral","Discord, Twitch, Spotify o cualquier app web siempre a mano en un lateral.","Actualizaciones invisibles","Las nuevas versiones se instalan en segundo plano – Falcon simplemente se reinicia.","Monitor de rendimiento con Game Mode","Dos webs una al lado de la otra en la vista dividida","Juegos gratis y ofertas en la página de inicio de Falcon","Todas las funciones de Falcon: Game Mode, limitador de red, vista dividida, bloqueador de anuncios, gestor de contraseñas, llaves de acceso, sincronización cifrada y más.","Falcon – El navegador para gamers","<a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Inicio</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funciones</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Capturas</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Descargar</a>","El navegador creado <span class=\"grad\">para gamers</span>.","Falcon devuelve a tus juegos CPU, memoria y ancho de banda – con Game Mode, limitador de red, bloqueador de anuncios integrado y sincronización cifrada de extremo a extremo.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/download\" data-cta=\"\"><svg/><span data-cta-label=\"\">Descargar gratis</span></a> <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/funktionen\">Todas las funciones<svg/></a>","<span><svg/>Gratis y de código abierto</span> <span><svg/>Windows, macOS y Linux</span> <span><svg/>Actualizaciones automáticas</span>","<b>150.000+</b><span>reglas de filtro contra anuncios</span>","<b>AES-256</b><span>cifrado de extremo a extremo</span>","<b>5</b><span>idiomas</span>","<b>0 €</b><span>gratis para siempre</span>","¿Por qué Falcon?","Todo lo que necesitas. <span class=\"grad\">Nada que frene.</span>","Falcon se basa en Chromium – todas las webs funcionan como siempre. Además trae funciones que otros navegadores no tienen.","Pausa las pestañas en segundo plano y las duerme para que tu juego tenga toda la potencia.","Limitador de red","Limita descargas y webs – para un ping estable aunque algo se esté cargando a la vez.","Más de 150.000 reglas de filtro bloquean anuncios, rastreadores y, si quieres, avisos de cookies.","Vista dividida","Guía y mapa, stream y chat: dos pestañas una al lado de la otra en una ventana.","Sincronización cifrada","Marcadores, contraseñas, historial y pestañas en todos tus PCs – legibles solo para ti.","Reúne monedas navegando, con la recompensa diaria y con misiones.","Más FPS. <span class=\"grad\">Menos lastre.</span>","Un clic y Falcon ordena en segundo plano: las pestañas que no necesitas ahora se pausan y después se duermen. El monitor de rendimiento te muestra en directo cuánta CPU y memoria usa Falcon.","<svg/><span><b>Pausa las pestañas en segundo plano</b> a los 30 segundos – sin cerrarlas</span>","<svg/><span><b>Las pestañas con sonido siguen activas</b> – tu música no se detiene</span>","<svg/><span><b>Límite de RAM</b>: Falcon se mantiene por debajo del límite que elijas</span>","<svg/><span><b>Limitador de red</b> incluido también</span>","Productivo","Todo con el teclado. <span class=\"grad\">Ctrl + K.</span>","La paleta de comandos encuentra pestañas abiertas, marcadores, tu historial y cualquier comando de Falcon – rapidísimo y sin ratón.","<svg/><span>Cambiar de pestaña, activar el Game Mode, abrir los ajustes</span>","<svg/><span>Abrir directamente las pestañas de tus otros PCs</span>","<svg/><span>Capturas con <b>Ctrl + Mayús + S</b></span>","Seguro","Tus datos son <span class=\"grad\">tuyos.</span>","Con una cuenta gratuita de Falcon tienes tus datos en cualquier PC. Todo se cifra en tu dispositivo antes de subirse – ni siquiera el servidor puede leerlo.","<svg/><span><b>Gestor de contraseñas</b> con generador y comprobación de filtraciones</span>","<svg/><span><b>Llaves de acceso</b> con iPhone, Android o llave de seguridad</span>","<svg/><span><b>App móvil</b> para Android e iOS con pestañas, contraseñas, FalCoins y tienda</span>","La página de inicio de Falcon con accesos directos y juegos gratis actuales","El monitor de rendimiento de Falcon con el Game Mode activado","La paleta de comandos de Falcon","El menú de cuenta de Falcon con FalCoins y estado de sincronización","Falcon es un navegador rápido y gratuito para gamers: Game Mode, limitador de red, bloqueador de anuncios, vista dividida y sincronización cifrada de extremo a extremo.","Capturas – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Inicio</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Funciones</a><a href=\"/screenshots\" aria-current=\"page\">Capturas</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>Descargar</a>","Capturas de pantalla","Así es <span class=\"grad\">Falcon</span>.","Oscuro, ordenado y rápido. Haz clic en una imagen para verla en grande.","<b>Página de inicio</b><span>Accesos directos, búsqueda y los juegos gratis actuales.</span>","<b>Rendimiento y Game Mode</b><span>CPU y memoria en directo – Game Mode con un clic.</span>","<b>Vista dividida</b><span>Dos páginas una al lado de la otra, línea divisoria movible.</span>","<b>Paleta de comandos</b><span>Pestañas, marcadores y comandos con Ctrl + K.</span>","<b>Juegos gratis y ofertas</b><span>Juegos gratis y descuentos de Steam, Epic y GOG.</span>","<b>Cuenta y FalCoins</b><span>Estado de sincronización, FalCoins y misiones en el menú de la cuenta.</span>","<b>Tienda de FalCoins</b><span>Tu saldo y todos los artículos de un vistazo.</span>","<b>Recompensas y misiones</b><span>Recompensa diaria con bonus por racha y misiones.</span>","Ampliar página de inicio","Página de inicio","Ampliar Rendimiento y Game Mode","Rendimiento y Game Mode","Ampliar vista dividida","Ampliar paleta de comandos","Paleta de comandos","Ampliar Juegos gratis y ofertas","Juegos gratis y ofertas","Ampliar Cuenta y FalCoins","Cuenta y FalCoins","Ampliar Recompensas y misiones","Recompensas y misiones","Capturas de Falcon: página de inicio, Game Mode, vista dividida, paleta de comandos, juegos gratis, tienda de FalCoins y más.","Versión {v}","Última versión","Última versión en GitHub","Aún no hay ninguna versión publicada","Próximamente","Llegará con la próxima versión","{a} y {b}","<b>La nueva versión se está preparando para la descarga.</b> Falcon {v} para {p} estará disponible en los próximos minutos.","Ir a la descarga","La versión {v} se está preparando para la descarga. Mientras tanto recibes la versión {o} – después se actualizará automáticamente.","La versión {v} se está preparando para la descarga. Mientras tanto recibes la versión anterior – después se actualizará automáticamente.","La versión {v} para {p} se está preparando para la descarga. Tardará unos minutos más.","La nueva versión de Android se está preparando para la descarga. Mientras tanto recibes la versión {o}.","La nueva versión de Android se está preparando para la descarga. Mientras tanto recibes la anterior.","Móvil Android","Tablet Android","PC con Linux","Chip de Apple","Descargar gratis","Descargar la app para Android","Descargar para dispositivos iOS","Descargar para macOS","Descargar para Linux","Detectado: {d}","Elige tu plataforma","Nuevo","De las <a>novedades</a> (en inglés).","Encontrarás todos los cambios en las <a>novedades en GitHub</a>.","Idioma","<b>Falcon {v} para {p} se está preparando para la descarga.</b> Tardará unos minutos más – {r} ya están disponibles.","<b>Falcon {v} para {p} se está preparando para la descarga.</b> Tardará unos minutos más – {r} ya está disponible.","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">Cargando la última versión …</span>","Detectando tu dispositivo …","<b>Falcon para Windows</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">Cargando la última versión …</span>","<b>Falcon para Android</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">Cargando la última versión …</span>","Cargando las novedades …","<svg/><span><b>Color de acento</b> – Falcon en tu color, también con colores propios</span>"],"tr":["Sayfa bulunamadı – Falcon","İçeriğe geç","<img src=\"/assets/logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Ana sayfa</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Özellikler</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Ekran görüntüleri</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">SSS</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>İndir</a>","<svg/>İndir","Hata 404","Bu sayfa <span class=\"grad\">uçup gitti.</span>","Bu adres yok (artık yok). Belki şu bağlantılardan biri işine yarar.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/\">Ana sayfaya git</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>İndir</a>","Oyuncular için hızlı ve sade tarayıcı. Ücretsiz ve açık kaynak.","Falcon","<a href=\"/funktionen\">Özellikler</a>","<a href=\"/screenshots\">Ekran görüntüleri</a>","<a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a>","<a href=\"/download\">İndir</a>","Yardım","<a href=\"/faq\">SSS</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sorun bildir</a>","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sürüm notları</a>","Proje","<a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>","<a href=\"/datenschutz\">Gizlilik</a>","<span>© <span data-year=\"\">2026</span> Falcon · MIT Lisansı</span> <span>Güncel sürüm <span data-version=\"\">…</span></span>","Falcon – Ana sayfa","Ana menü","Menüyü aç","Bu sayfa yok.","Gizlilik – Falcon","Yasal","Gizlilik","Bu web sitesi ve Falcon tarayıcısı verilerini nasıl işliyor.","Kısaca: Bu web sitesi çerez kullanmaz, analiz veya reklam izleyicisi kullanmaz ve üçüncü taraflardan yazı tipi ya da betik yüklemez. Falcon tarayıcısı da izleyici içermez; senkronize edilen veriler uçtan uca şifrelenir.","1. Sorumlu","Bu web sitesinden ve Falcon tarayıcısından Falcon’un geliştiricisi Calvin sorumludur.","Gizlilikle ilgili sorularını <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub’daki issues</a> üzerinden veya Falcon’daki “Sorun bildir” ile sorabilirsin.","2. Bu web sitesi","Vercel’de barındırma","Bu web sitesi Vercel Inc., 440 N Barranca Ave #4133, Covina, CA 91723, ABD tarafından barındırılır. Ziyaretinde Vercel, sayfayı sunmak ve saldırılara karşı korumak için IP adresi, tarih ve saat, açılan sayfa, tarayıcı ve işletim sistemi gibi teknik olarak gerekli verileri işler. Hukuki dayanak, güvenli ve kararlı bir işleyişe yönelik meşru menfaatimizdir (GDPR md. 6/1-f). Vercel, EU-US Data Privacy Framework kapsamında sertifikalıdır; ayrıntılar <a href=\"https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vercel’in gizlilik politikasında</a>.","GitHub’dan güncel sürüm","İndirme düğmesi, sürüm numarası ve yenilikler her zaman güncel olsun diye tarayıcın bu siteyi ziyaret ettiğinde GitHub’dan herkese açık bilgiler alır (<code>api.github.com</code>, <code>raw.githubusercontent.com</code>). Bu sırada IP adresin GitHub Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, ABD’ye iletilir. İndirmenin kendisi de GitHub üzerinden yapılır. Hukuki dayanak GDPR md. 6/1-f’dir. Ayrıca <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/de/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub’ın gizlilik politikasına</a> bakabilirsin.","Çerezler ve yerel depolama","Bu web sitesi çerez kullanmaz. Alınan sürüm numarası ve seçtiğin dil, sayfa daha hızlı yüklensin diye tarayıcının yerel depolamasında saklanır; bunları istediğin zaman tarayıcı ayarlarından silebilirsin.","3. Falcon tarayıcısı","Falcon hesap olmadan da çalışır. Bu durumda yer imleri, geçmiş ve ayarlar bilgisayarında kalır. Kayıtlı parolalar işletim sisteminin şifrelemesiyle korunur.","Falcon hesabı, senkronizasyon ve FalCoins","Bir Falcon hesabı oluşturursan oturum açma ve veri depolama Google Firebase (Google Ireland Ltd., Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, İrlanda) üzerinden yürütülür. E-posta adresin, görünen adın, FalCoin bakiyen, satın aldığın kilit açmalar, görev ilerlemen ve FalCoin geçmişin saklanır.","Yer imleri, parolalar, geçmiş, ayarlar ve açık sekmeler <b>yüklenmeden önce cihazında şifrelenir</b> (AES-256-GCM). Anahtar parolanla korunur; ne Firebase ne de geliştirici bu verileri okuyabilir. Hukuki dayanak hesap işlevlerinin sağlanmasıdır (GDPR md. 6/1-b). Hesabını tüm verileriyle birlikte istediğin zaman Falcon’da <b>Ayarlar → Hesap &amp; Senkronizasyon → Hesabı sil</b> bölümünden silebilirsin.","Sorun bildirimleri","Falcon’da bir sorun bildirirsen açıklama, bildirim türü, Falcon sürümü ve tarih kaydedilir. Açıklama <code>falcon://reports</code> adresinde tüm Falcon kullanıcıları tarafından anonim olarak görülebilir – lütfen kişisel bilgi yazma. E-posta adresi, sayfa adresi, ekran görüntüsü ve işletim sistemi isteğe bağlıdır ve yalnızca geliştirici tarafından görülür.","Diğer hizmetler","<b>Güncellemeler:</b> Falcon yeni sürümleri GitHub’a sorar.","Başlangıç sayfasındaki <b>ücretsiz oyunlar &amp; indirimler</b> GamerPower ve CheapShark’tan gelir (kapatılabilir).","<b>Site simgeleri</b> (favicon’lar) bir Google hizmeti üzerinden yüklenir.","<b>Reklam engelleyici:</b> filtre listeleri haftada bir herkese açık kaynaklardan indirilir.","<b>Parola kontrolü:</b> “Have I Been Pwned”e yalnızca bir hash değerinin ilk 5 karakteri gönderilir – parolanın kendisi asla.","<b>Sayfayı çevir</b> sayfanın metnini Google Çeviri’ye gönderir.","<b>Uzantılar</b> Google’ın Chrome Web Mağazası’ndan yüklenir.","4. Hakların","Bilgi alma (GDPR md. 15), düzeltme (md. 16), silme (md. 17), işlemenin kısıtlanması (md. 18), veri taşınabilirliği (md. 20) ve meşru menfaate dayanan işlemelere itiraz (md. 21) hakların vardır. Ayrıca bir veri koruma denetim makamına şikâyette bulunabilirsin (GDPR md. 77).","5. Değişiklikler","Bu gizlilik politikası Falcon veya bu web sitesi değiştiğinde güncellenir. Son güncelleme: Kasım 2026.","falconbrowser.de ve Falcon tarayıcısı için gizlilik politikası.","İndir – Falcon","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">En yeni sürüm</span>","Falcon’u <span class=\"grad\">indir</span>","Ücretsiz, reklamsız ve açık kaynak. Kurulumdan sonra Falcon kendini güncel tutar.","Algılandı: Windows PC · Windows 11","<span class=\"dl-select-ic\" data-platform-icon=\"\"><svg/></span> <span class=\"dl-select-label\">Sürüm:</span> <b data-platform-current=\"\">Windows PC</b> <svg/>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Windows PC</b><small>Windows 10 ve 11</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Android</b><small>Telefon ve tablet, APK</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>iOS cihazları</b><small>.ipa</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>macOS</b><small>Apple çip ve Intel</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","<span class=\"dl-opt-ic\"><svg/></span><span class=\"dl-opt-text\"><b>Linux</b><small>.deb ve .rpm</small></span><span class=\"dl-opt-check\"><svg/></span>","Windows PC","Android","iOS cihazları","macOS","Linux","<b>Windows için Falcon</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">GitHub’daki en yeni sürüm</span>","<svg/>Windows için indir","Windows 10 ve 11 (64 bit) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eski sürümler</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kaynak kodu</a>","<b>Android için Falcon</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">GitHub’daki en yeni sürüm</span>","<svg/><span data-apk-label=\"\">Android için indir</span>","Android 7 veya üzeri · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eski sürümler</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kaynak kodu</a>","<b>macOS için Falcon</b><span data-mac-meta=\"\">En yeni sürüm yükleniyor …</span>","<svg/><span>Apple çipli Mac için (M1–M4)</span>","<svg/><span>Intel işlemcili Mac için</span>","macOS 11 (Big Sur) veya üzeri · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eski sürümler</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kaynak kodu</a>","<b>Linux için Falcon</b><span data-linux-meta=\"\">En yeni sürüm yükleniyor …</span>","<svg/><span>.deb – Ubuntu, Debian, Mint</span>","<svg/><span>.rpm – Fedora, openSUSE</span>","64 bit (x86_64) · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eski sürümler</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kaynak kodu</a>","<b>iOS cihazları için Falcon</b><span data-ios-meta=\"\">En yeni sürüm yükleniyor …</span>","<svg/><span>.ipa indir</span>","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 veya üzeri · <a href=\"https://github.com/nab138/iloader/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iloader</a> ile kurulum (Windows, macOS, Linux) · Kurmadan: <a href=\"/app\">Falcon web uygulaması</a>","<b data-soon-title=\"\">Yakında</b><span>Hazırlanıyor</span>","Falcon web uygulamasına git","Yukarıdan istediğin zaman başka bir sürüm seçebilirsin.","Üç adımda hazır","Kurulum dosyasını indir","Yukarıdaki “Windows için indir”e tıkla. Dosyanın adı <code>Falcon-Setup-<span data-version=\"\">…</span>.exe</code>.","Kurulumu başlat","Windows “Windows bilgisayarınızı korudu” derse <b>Ek bilgi → Yine de çalıştır</b>a tıkla. Falcon henüz dijital olarak imzalanmadı.","Başla","Falcon hemen açılır. Yer imlerini ve parolaları Chrome, Edge, Opera veya Firefox’tan içe aktarabilirsin.","Android telefonda Falcon","APK’yı indir","Bu sayfayı telefonunda aç ve yukarıdaki “Android için indir”e dokun. Dosyanın adı <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-apk-version=\"\">…</span>.apk</code>.","Kuruluma izin ver","Android, tarayıcının uygulama yükleyip yükleyemeyeceğini sorar. <b>Ayarlar → Bu kaynağa izin ver</b>e, ardından <b>Yükle</b>ye dokun. Falcon henüz Play Store’da değil.","Oturum aç","Falcon hesabınla oturum aç – ya da doğrudan uygulamada bir hesap oluştur. Yer imlerin, parolaların, geçmişin ve FalCoin’lerin telefonda ve bilgisayarda aynı olur.","Mac’te Falcon","DMG’yi indir","Yukarıdan Mac’ini seç: <b>Apple çip</b> (M1, M2, M3, M4) veya <b>Intel</b>. Hangisine sahip olduğunu  → <b>Bu Mac Hakkında</b> altında görebilirsin.","“Uygulamalar”a sürükle","İndirilen dosyayı aç ve Falcon’u <b>Uygulamalar</b> klasörüne sürükle.","İlk açılışta izin ver","Falcon henüz Apple tarafından imzalanmadı. Uygulamalar klasöründe Falcon’a sağ tıkla → <b>Aç</b> → <b>Aç</b>. macOS uygulamanın “hasarlı” olduğunu söylerse Terminal’de <code>xattr -cr /Applications/Falcon.app</code> yaz ve Falcon’u yeniden başlat.","Linux’ta Falcon","Paketi seç","Ubuntu, Debian, Linux Mint, Pop!_OS için <b>.deb</b> · Fedora, openSUSE, RHEL için <b>.rpm</b>.","Kur","Dosyaya çift tıklamak yazılım yöneticisini açar. Terminalde: <code>sudo apt install ./Falcon-*.deb</code> veya <code>sudo dnf install ./Falcon-*.rpm</code>.","Falcon’u ardından uygulama menüsünde bulursun. Falcon, Windows’taki gibi arka planda kendini günceller.","iOS cihazlarında Falcon","Falcon App Store’da yok. .ipa dosyasını bilgisayarından ücretsiz <b>iloader</b> programıyla kurarsın – Windows, macOS veya Linux’ta, normal Apple kimliğinle.","iloader’ı indir","iloader’ı <b>github.com/nab138/iloader</b> adresinde “Releases” altından ücretsiz indir (veya <b>iloader.app</b> adresinden – yalnızca bu iki kaynak resmidir). Windows: <code>iloader-windows-x64.msi</code>, macOS: <code>iloader-darwin-universal.dmg</code>, Linux: <code>.deb</code>, <code>.rpm</code> veya <code>.AppImage</code>. GitHub’daki “Sponsor” düğmesi yalnızca isteğe bağlı bir bağıştır.","Bilgisayarın cihazı tanıması için","<b>Windows:</b> ayrıca Apple’ın <b>iTunes</b> uygulamasını kur. <b>macOS:</b> hiçbir şey gerekmez. <b>Linux:</b> eksikse <code>usbmuxd</code> kur (Debian/Ubuntu: <code>sudo apt install usbmuxd</code>).",".ipa’yı bilgisayara indir","Yukarıdan <code>Falcon-Mobile-<span data-ios-version=\"\">…</span>.ipa</code> dosyasını bilgisayarına indir.","Cihazı bağla","iPhone veya iPad’ini bir <b>veri kablosuyla</b> bağla, kilidini aç ve “Güven”e dokun. “Güven” sorusu gelmiyor ve cihaz yalnızca şarj oluyorsa başka bir kablo veya USB girişi dene.","iloader’da oturum aç","iloader’ı aç ve Apple kimliğinle oturum aç (ücretsiz bir kimlik yeterli). Oturum açma başarısız olursa iloader ayarlarında “Reset Anisette State”i seç ve iloader’ı yeniden başlat.","Falcon’u kur","iloader’da cihazını seç, ardından <b>“Import IPA”</b> ve Falcon .ipa dosyasını seç. iloader, Falcon’u Apple kimliğinle imzalar ve cihaza kurar.","Cihazda izin ver","<b>Ayarlar → Gizlilik ve Güvenlik → Geliştirici Modu</b> altında Geliştirici Modu’nu aç (seçenek yalnızca kurulumdan sonra görünür, ardından yeniden başlat) ve <b>Ayarlar → Genel → VPN ve Aygıt Yönetimi</b> altında Apple kimliğine güven. Ardından Falcon açılır.","7 günde bir yeniden kur","Ücretsiz bir Apple kimliğiyle imza 7 gün sonra sona erer. O zaman cihazı yeniden bağla ve Falcon’u iloader ile tekrar kur – verilerin korunur. Yeni Falcon sürümlerini de aynı şekilde kurarsın.","Yenilikler neler?","Yenilikler","Tüm değişiklikleri <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub’daki sürüm notlarında</a> bulabilirsin.","Sistem gereksinimleri","Windows","Windows 10 veya 11, 64 bit","macOS 11 (Big Sur) veya üzeri, Apple çip veya Intel","64 bit, ör. Ubuntu 20.04+, Debian 11+, Fedora 36+ (.deb veya .rpm)","Bellek","4 GB (8 GB önerilir)","Disk alanı","yaklaşık 400 MB","Android 7.0 veya üzeri","iOS / iPadOS 16.4 veya üzeri, bilgisayarda iloader ile kurulum (Windows, macOS veya Linux)","Falcon logosu","Platform seç","Platform","Falcon’u Windows, macOS, Linux, Android ve iOS için ücretsiz indir. Otomatik güncellemeler, reklamsız, açık kaynak.","FalCoins – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Ana sayfa</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Özellikler</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Ekran görüntüleri</a><a href=\"/falcoins\" aria-current=\"page\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">SSS</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>İndir</a>","FalCoins","Gezinmek artık <span class=\"grad\">iki kat kazandırıyor.</span>","Ücretsiz bir Falcon hesabıyla FalCoin toplarsın: gezinirken, günlük ödülle ve görevlerle.","<span class=\"grad\">FalCoin</span> nasıl kazanılır","Web sitelerini ziyaret et","Oturum açıkken ziyaret ettiğin her sayfa için.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Ziyaret başına +1","Günlük ödül","Paralarını her gün topla – üst üste 7. günde bonus var.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>+10 · +50 bonus","Görevler","Her gün üç yeni görev, ör. “20 sayfa ziyaret et” veya “30 dakika Game Mode kullan”.","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>günde +45’e kadar","Her şey göz önünde","FalCoin geçmişi her kazancı ve her satın almayı tarihiyle gösterir.","Şeffaf","FalCoin mağazası","Artık her şey <span class=\"grad\">ücretsiz</span>","Tüm beta özellikleri herkese ücretsiz – hesap ve FalCoin olmadan bile.","Beta erişimi <span class=\"tag\" style=\"margin-left:6px\">Herkese ücretsiz</span>","Beta erişimini artık satın alman gerekmiyor: tüm özellikleri artık Falcon’un bir parçası.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b> – arka plandaki sekmeleri duraklatır ve uyutur, böylece oyunun işlemci ve bellek alır</span>","<svg/><span><b>RGB modu</b> – vurgu rengi tüm renklerde döner, sekmeler ve düğmeler parlar</span>","<svg/><span><b>İndirim istek listesi</b> – bir oyun ücretsiz veya indirimli olduğunda Falcon haber verir</span>","<svg/><span><b>Sayfayı çevir</b> – web sitelerini doğrudan Falcon’da kendi diline çevir</span>","<svg/><span>Hesap ve FalCoin olmadan kullanılabilir</span>","<svg/><span>“30 dakika Game Mode” görevinin kilidi açılır</span>","<svg/><span>Süre sınırı yok</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Herkese ücretsiz","Game Mode","Game Mode herkese ücretsiz – araç çubuğundan açman yeterli.","<svg/><span>Arka plandaki sekmeleri 30 saniye sonra duraklatır</span>","<svg/><span>Sonra uyutur, animasyonları kapatır</span>","<svg/><span>Ses çalan sekmeler etkin kalır</span>","<span class=\"coin\"><svg/></span>Herkese ücretsiz","<b>FalCoin mağazası</b><span>Hesap menüsünde FalCoin’lerine tıkla.</span>","<b>Ödüller &amp; görevler</b><span>Her gün yeni.</span>","<span class=\"grad\">Kalkışa</span> hazır mısın?","Falcon ücretsizdir, bir dakikada kurulur ve sonra arka planda kendini günceller.","<svg/>Ücretsiz indir","FalCoin mağazasını büyüt","FalCoin mağazası","Ödülleri büyüt","Günlük ödül ve görevler","Kapat","Önceki resim","Sonraki resim","Gezinirken, günlük ödülle ve görevlerle FalCoin topla. Falcon’un tüm beta özellikleri herkese ücretsiz.","SSS – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Ana sayfa</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Özellikler</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Ekran görüntüleri</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\" aria-current=\"page\">SSS</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>İndir</a>","SSS","Sık sorulan <span class=\"grad\">sorular</span>","Sorun burada yok mu? <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">GitHub’da sor</a> veya Falcon’da “Sorun bildir”i kullan.","Genel","Falcon ücretsiz mi?<svg/>","Evet. Falcon tamamen ücretsiz ve açık kaynaktır (MIT lisansı). Reklam ve abonelik yoktur.","Falcon hangi teknolojiye dayanıyor?<svg/>","Falcon, Chrome, Edge ve Opera ile aynı temel olan Chromium’a dayanır. Bu yüzden web siteleri orada olduğu gibi çalışır.","Falcon Mac, Linux veya telefon için var mı?<svg/>","Evet. Falcon Windows 10 ve 11, macOS (Apple çip ve Intel) ve Linux (.deb ve .rpm) için mevcut – hepsi <a href=\"/download\">indirme sayfasında</a>. Android telefonlar için Falcon Mobile uygulaması var. iOS cihazları için Falcon Mobile, bilgisayarından ücretsiz iloader programıyla kurduğun bir .ipa olarak sunulur (App Store’da değil).","Windows kurulumda neden uyarı veriyor?<svg/>","Falcon henüz dijital olarak imzalanmadığı için Windows SmartScreen bir uyarı gösterir. <b>Ek bilgi → Yine de çalıştır</b>a tıkla. Kaynak kodunu herkes GitHub’da inceleyebilir.","Güncellemeleri nasıl alırım?<svg/>","Otomatik olarak. Falcon açılışta yeni sürümleri arar, indirir ve arka planda kurar – ardından Falcon yeniden başlar. “Başlangıçta” ayarında son oturum seçiliyse (varsayılan) sekmelerin geri gelir. İki veya daha fazla sürüm gerideysen güncelleme zorunludur: o zamana kadar Falcon hesabın ve bazı özellikler kilitlidir; ardından oturumun otomatik açılır.","Falcon’u varsayılan tarayıcı yapabilir miyim?<svg/>","Evet, <b>Ayarlar → Genel → Varsayılan yap</b> bölümünden. Falcon ayrıca Windows ayarlarında <b>Uygulamalar → Varsayılan uygulamalar</b> altında görünür.","Oyun","Game Mode tam olarak ne yapar?<svg/>","Arka plandaki sekmeleri 30 saniye sonra duraklatır, daha sonra uyutur ve animasyonları kapatır. Böylece oyunun daha fazla işlemci ve bellek alır. Ses çalan sekmeler etkin kalır.","Game Mode’u nasıl alırım?<svg/>","Açman yeterli: Game Mode herkese ücretsiz, hesap olmadan bile. Araç çubuğundaki kumanda simgesine tıkla veya Ctrl+Shift+G’ye bas.","Mağazada yanlışlıkla bir şey aldım – şimdi ne olacak?<svg/>","FalCoin mağazasını aç ve <b>İade talep et</b>e dokun. Satın alımı seç, e-posta adresini ve kısaca nedenini yaz. Yanıtı Falcon’u bir sonraki açışında alırsın. İade onaylanırsa FalCoin’lerini geri alırsın. <b>Önemli:</b> Beta erişimi için iadeyi yalnızca satın alımdan sonraki <b>24 saat</b> içinde talep edebilirsin – sonrasında değil.","Ağ sınırlayıcı ne işe yarar?<svg/>","Web sitelerinin ve indirmelerin bant genişliğini sınırlar, böylece oyunun kararlı bir ping için yeterli bağlantıya sahip olur – istersen her zaman, istersen yalnızca Game Mode’da.","Netflix ve Disney+ çalışıyor mu?<svg/>","Henüz değil. Bu hizmetler, Falcon’un şu anda içermediği bir kopya koruması (Widevine) gerektirir.","Hesap, senkronizasyon &amp; FalCoins","Hesaba ihtiyacım var mı?<svg/>","Hayır. Falcon hesap olmadan da çalışır. Ücretsiz bir Falcon hesabına yalnızca bilgisayarlar arası senkronizasyon, mobil uygulama ve FalCoins için ihtiyacın var.","Senkronize edilen verilerim ne kadar güvende?<svg/>","Yer imleri, parolalar, geçmiş, ayarlar ve sekmeler yüklenmeden önce bilgisayarında AES-256 ile şifrelenir. Anahtar parolanla korunur – sunucu yalnızca okunamayan veriler görür.","Parolamı unuttum – şimdi ne olacak?<svg/>","“Parolanı mı unuttun?” ile e-postayla bir bağlantı alırsın. Ardından senkronize verilerinin kilidini bir kez eski parolanla açarsın – ya da bilgisayarındaki verilerle yeniden başlarsın.","FalCoins nedir?<svg/>","Gezinirken topladığın paralar: ziyaret edilen her site için 1, ödül olarak günde 10 (üst üste 7. günde bonusla) ve görevler için günde en fazla 45. Falcon’un özellikleri için artık gerekli değiller – hepsi ücretsiz.","Uzantılar &amp; gizlilik","Chrome uzantıları çalışıyor mu?<svg/>","Birçoğu evet. Chrome Web Mağazası’ndaki her uzantı sayfasında <b>“Falcon’a ekle”</b> düğmesi görünür. Falcon uzantı arayüzlerinin yalnızca bir kısmını desteklediğinden bazı uzantılar kısmen çalışır.","Falcon hakkımda veri topluyor mu?<svg/>","Hayır. Falcon analiz veya reklam izleyicisi içermez. Ayrıntılar <a href=\"/datenschutz\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">gizlilik politikasında</a>.","Bir sorunu nasıl bildiririm?<svg/>","Falcon’da ana menüdeki <b>“Sorun bildir …”</b> ile veya <a href=\"https://github.com/calvinistkrass/Falcon/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#b3aaff\">GitHub</a>’da.","Falcon hakkında sık sorulan soruların yanıtları: ücret, güncellemeler, Game Mode, senkronizasyon, FalCoins, uzantılar ve gizlilik.","Özellikler – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Ana sayfa</a><a href=\"/funktionen\" aria-current=\"page\">Özellikler</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Ekran görüntüleri</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">SSS</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>İndir</a>","Özellikler","<span class=\"grad\">Senin düzenin</span> için yapıldı.","Game Mode’dan uçtan uca şifrelemeye: Falcon’un içindeki her şey.","🎮 Oyun","<span class=\"grad\">Oyunun için</span> tam güç.","Falcon, sen oynarken tarayıcının arka planda çalıştığını bilir – ve ona göre davranır.","<svg/><span><b>Game Mode</b>: arka plandaki sekmeleri duraklatır ve uyutur, animasyonları kapatır</span>","<svg/><span><b>Ağ sınırlayıcı</b>: 2 ila 100 Mbit/s, her zaman veya yalnızca Game Mode’da</span>","<svg/><span><b>RAM sınırı</b>: sınıra ulaşıldığında kullanılmayan sekmeler uyur</span>","<svg/><span><b>Yer üstü pencere</b>: yayın veya rehber her zaman önde kalır</span>","<svg/><span><b>Sekme başına ses</b> ve videolar için resim içinde resim</span>","🧭 Gezinme","İki sekme. <span class=\"grad\">Tek pencere.</span>","Bölünmüş görünüm iki sayfayı yan yana gösterir – ayırıcı serbestçe kaydırılabilir.","<svg/><span><b>Bölünmüş görünüm</b>, kaydırılabilir ayırıcıyla</span>","<svg/><span>Sekmeler, yer imleri ve komutlar için <b>komut paleti</b> (Ctrl + K)</span>","<svg/><span>Dikkat dağıtmayan makaleler için <b>okuma görünümü</b> (F9)</span>","<svg/><span><b>Ekran görüntüsü aracı</b>: alan, görünen kısım veya tüm sayfa</span>","<svg/><span>Arama, hız ve devam ettirme özellikli <b>indirmeler sayfası</b></span>","🕹️ Başlangıç sayfası","Ücretsiz oyunlar <span class=\"grad\">doğrudan ekranda.</span>","Başlangıç sayfası hangi oyunların şu an ücretsiz olduğunu ve hangi indirimlerin değdiğini gösterir – Steam, Epic Games ve GOG’dan.","<svg/><span>Kalan süreyle güncel <b>ücretsiz oyunlar</b></span>","<svg/><span>İndirim oranı ve fiyatla <b>fırsatlar</b></span>","<svg/><span>Kendi kısayolların, saat ve arka plan resmi</span>","Ve çok daha fazlası","Küçük şeyler, <span class=\"grad\">büyük fark.</span>","Reklam engelleyici","EasyList, EasyPrivacy ve fazlası – 150.000’den fazla kural, haftalık güncellenir. Falcon kalkanı neyin engellendiğini gösterir. Mobil uygulamada da var.","Parola yöneticisi","Oturum bilgilerini şifreli saklar, güçlü parolalar önerir ve veri sızıntıları ile tekrar kullanılan parolalar konusunda uyarır.","Geçiş anahtarları","Windows Hello, iPhone’un, Android telefonun veya bir güvenlik anahtarıyla oturum aç.","Hesap &amp; senkronizasyon","Yer imleri, parolalar, geçmiş, ayarlar ve açık sekmeler – uçtan uca şifreli.","Mobil uygulama","Android ve iOS için Falcon: sekmeler, yer imleri, parolalar, reklam engelleyici, FalCoins ve mağaza – bilgisayardaki gibi.","Sekme önizlemesi","Fareyle bir sekmenin üzerine gel ve sayfanın küçük bir resmini anında gör – sekme değiştirmeden.","RGB modu","Vurgu rengi tüm renklerde döner, sekmeler ve düğmeler oyuncu klavyen gibi parlar.","İndirim istek listesi","Oyunları kaydet – biri ücretsiz ya da en az %20 indirimli olduğunda Falcon haber verir.","Chrome uzantıları","Doğrudan Chrome Web Mağazası’ndan “Falcon’a ekle” düğmesiyle kur.","Gizli pencereler","Bellekte ayrı bir oturum: kapattığında her şey silinir.","Sayfayı çevir","Web sitelerini doğrudan Falcon’da kendi diline çevir – başka bir siteye uğramadan. Sağ tıkla, Ctrl + K ile veya mobil uygulamanın menüsünden.","5 dil","Deutsch, English, Français, Español ve Türkçe – Falcon sistem dilini takip eder.","Varsayılan tarayıcı","Diğer programlardaki bağlantılar ve HTML dosyaları istersen Falcon’da açılır.","Kenar çubuğu","Discord, Twitch, Spotify veya herhangi bir web uygulaması her zaman yanda el altında.","Görünmez güncellemeler","Yeni sürümler arka planda kurulur – Falcon sadece yeniden başlar.","Game Mode ile performans göstergesi","Bölünmüş görünümde yan yana iki web sitesi","Falcon’un başlangıç sayfasında ücretsiz oyunlar ve indirimler","Falcon’un tüm özellikleri: Game Mode, ağ sınırlayıcı, bölünmüş görünüm, reklam engelleyici, parola yöneticisi, geçiş anahtarları, şifreli senkronizasyon ve daha fazlası.","Falcon – Oyuncular için tarayıcı","<a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Ana sayfa</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Özellikler</a><a href=\"/screenshots\">Ekran görüntüleri</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">SSS</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>İndir</a>","<span class=\"grad\">Oyuncular için</span> yapılmış tarayıcı.","Falcon oyunlarına işlemciyi, belleği ve bant genişliğini geri verir – Game Mode, ağ sınırlayıcı, yerleşik reklam engelleyici ve uçtan uca şifreli senkronizasyonla.","<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"/download\" data-cta=\"\"><svg/><span data-cta-label=\"\">Ücretsiz indir</span></a> <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"/funktionen\">Tüm özellikler<svg/></a>","<span><svg/>Ücretsiz &amp; açık kaynak</span> <span><svg/>Windows, macOS &amp; Linux</span> <span><svg/>Otomatik güncellemeler</span>","<b>150.000+</b><span>reklamlara karşı filtre kuralı</span>","<b>AES-256</b><span>uçtan uca şifreleme</span>","<b>5</b><span>dil</span>","<b>0 €</b><span>sonsuza dek ücretsiz</span>","Neden Falcon?","İhtiyacın olan her şey. <span class=\"grad\">Yavaşlatan hiçbir şey.</span>","Falcon, Chromium’a dayanır – tüm web siteleri alıştığın gibi çalışır. Üstüne diğer tarayıcılarda olmayan özellikler gelir.","Arka plandaki sekmeleri duraklatır ve uyutur, böylece oyunun tam güç alır.","Ağ sınırlayıcı","İndirmeleri ve web sitelerini sınırlar – arka planda bir şey yüklenirken bile kararlı bir ping için.","150.000’den fazla filtre kuralı reklamları, izleyicileri ve istersen çerez bildirimlerini engeller.","Bölünmüş görünüm","Rehber ve harita, yayın ve sohbet: tek pencerede yan yana iki sekme.","Şifreli senkronizasyon","Tüm bilgisayarlarında yer imleri, parolalar, geçmiş ve sekmeler – yalnızca senin okuyabileceğin şekilde.","Gezinirken, günlük ödülle ve görevlerle para topla.","Daha fazla FPS. <span class=\"grad\">Daha az yük.</span>","Tek tıkla Falcon arka planda toparlar: şu an ihtiyacın olmayan sekmeler duraklatılır ve sonra uyutulur. Performans göstergesi Falcon’un ne kadar işlemci ve bellek kullandığını canlı gösterir.","<svg/><span><b>Arka plandaki sekmeleri</b> 30 saniye sonra duraklatır – kapatmadan</span>","<svg/><span><b>Ses çalan sekmeler etkin kalır</b> – müziğin çalmaya devam eder</span>","<svg/><span><b>RAM sınırı</b>: Falcon belirlediğin sınırın altında kalır</span>","<svg/><span><b>Ağ sınırlayıcı</b> da dahil</span>","Verimli","Her şey klavyeyle. <span class=\"grad\">Ctrl + K.</span>","Komut paleti açık sekmeleri, yer imlerini, geçmişini ve Falcon’daki her komutu bulur – şimşek hızında ve faresiz.","<svg/><span>Sekme değiştir, Game Mode’u aç/kapat, ayarları aç</span>","<svg/><span>Diğer bilgisayarlarındaki sekmeleri doğrudan aç</span>","<svg/><span><b>Ctrl + Shift + S</b> ile ekran görüntüleri</span>","Güvenli","Verilerin <span class=\"grad\">sana ait.</span>","Ücretsiz bir Falcon hesabıyla verilerin her bilgisayarda seninle. Her şey yüklenmeden önce cihazında şifrelenir – sunucu bile okuyamaz.","<svg/><span>Üreteç ve sızıntı kontrolü olan <b>parola yöneticisi</b></span>","<svg/><span>iPhone, Android veya güvenlik anahtarıyla <b>geçiş anahtarları</b></span>","<svg/><span>Sekmeler, parolalar, FalCoins ve mağazayla Android ve iOS için <b>mobil uygulama</b></span>","Kısayollar ve güncel ücretsiz oyunlarla Falcon’un başlangıç sayfası","Game Mode açıkken Falcon’un performans göstergesi","Falcon’un komut paleti","FalCoins ve senkronizasyon durumuyla Falcon’un hesap menüsü","Falcon, oyuncular için hızlı ve ücretsiz bir tarayıcı: Game Mode, ağ sınırlayıcı, reklam engelleyici, bölünmüş görünüm ve uçtan uca şifreli senkronizasyon.","Ekran görüntüleri – Falcon","<a href=\"/\">Ana sayfa</a><a href=\"/funktionen\">Özellikler</a><a href=\"/screenshots\" aria-current=\"page\">Ekran görüntüleri</a><a href=\"/falcoins\">FalCoins</a><a href=\"/faq\">SSS</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/download\"><svg/>İndir</a>","Ekran görüntüleri","<span class=\"grad\">Falcon</span> böyle görünüyor.","Koyu, düzenli ve hızlı. Büyük görmek için bir resme tıkla.","<b>Başlangıç sayfası</b><span>Kısayollar, arama ve güncel ücretsiz oyunlar.</span>","<b>Performans &amp; Game Mode</b><span>Canlı işlemci ve bellek – tek tıkla Game Mode.</span>","<b>Bölünmüş görünüm</b><span>Yan yana iki sayfa, ayırıcı serbestçe kaydırılabilir.</span>","<b>Komut paleti</b><span>Ctrl + K ile sekmeler, yer imleri ve komutlar.</span>","<b>Ücretsiz oyunlar &amp; indirimler</b><span>Steam, Epic ve GOG’dan ücretsiz oyunlar ve indirimler.</span>","<b>Hesap &amp; FalCoins</b><span>Hesap menüsünde senkronizasyon durumu, FalCoins ve görevler.</span>","<b>FalCoin mağazası</b><span>Bakiyen ve tüm ürünler tek bakışta.</span>","<b>Ödüller &amp; görevler</b><span>Seri bonuslu günlük ödül ve görevler.</span>","Başlangıç sayfasını büyüt","Başlangıç sayfası","Performans & Game Mode’u büyüt","Performans & Game Mode","Bölünmüş görünümü büyüt","Komut paletini büyüt","Komut paleti","Ücretsiz oyunlar & indirimleri büyüt","Ücretsiz oyunlar & indirimler","Hesap & FalCoins’i büyüt","Hesap & FalCoins","Ödüller & görevleri büyüt","Ödüller & görevler","Falcon’un ekran görüntüleri: başlangıç sayfası, Game Mode, bölünmüş görünüm, komut paleti, ücretsiz oyunlar, FalCoin mağazası ve daha fazlası.","Sürüm {v}","En yeni sürüm","GitHub’daki en yeni sürüm","Henüz yayımlanmış sürüm yok","Yakında","Bir sonraki sürümle gelecek","{a} ve {b}","<b>Yeni sürüm indirme için hazırlanıyor.</b> {p} için Falcon {v} birkaç dakika içinde hazır olacak.","İndirmeye git","Sürüm {v} indirme için hazırlanıyor. O zamana kadar sürüm {o}’u alırsın – sonrasında kendini otomatik günceller.","Sürüm {v} indirme için hazırlanıyor. O zamana kadar önceki sürümü alırsın – sonrasında kendini otomatik günceller.","{p} için sürüm {v} indirme için hazırlanıyor. Bu birkaç dakika daha sürer.","Yeni Android sürümü indirme için hazırlanıyor. O zamana kadar sürüm {o}’u alırsın.","Yeni Android sürümü indirme için hazırlanıyor. O zamana kadar öncekini alırsın.","Android telefon","Android tablet","Linux PC","Apple çip","Ücretsiz indir","Android uygulamasını indir","iOS cihazları için indir","macOS için indir","Linux için indir","Algılandı: {d}","Platformunu seç","Yeni","<a>Sürüm notlarından</a> (İngilizce).","Tüm değişiklikleri <a>GitHub’daki sürüm notlarında</a> bulabilirsin.","Dil","<b>{p} için Falcon {v} indirme için hazırlanıyor.</b> Bu birkaç dakika daha sürer – {r} zaten hazır.","<b>{p} için Falcon {v} indirme için hazırlanıyor.</b> Bu birkaç dakika daha sürer – {r} zaten hazır.","<i></i><span data-badge-text=\"\">En yeni sürüm yükleniyor …</span>","Cihazın algılanıyor …","<b>Windows için Falcon</b><span data-win-meta=\"\">En yeni sürüm yükleniyor …</span>","<b>Android için Falcon</b><span data-apk-meta=\"\">En yeni sürüm yükleniyor …</span>","Yenilikler yükleniyor …","<svg/><span><b>Vurgu rengi</b> – Falcon senin renginde, özel renkler dahil</span>"]};
